    "NivaDesk is operated by EGGCRAFT LIMITED, a company registered in the United Kingdom.": ["Türkçe": "NivaDesk, Birleşik Krallık'ta kayıtlı EGGCRAFT LIMITED tarafından işletilir.", "English": "NivaDesk is operated by EGGCRAFT LIMITED, a company registered in the United Kingdom.", "Deutsch": "NivaDesk wird von EGGCRAFT LIMITED betrieben, einem in Großbritannien registrierten Unternehmen.", "Français": "NivaDesk est exploité par EGGCRAFT LIMITED, société enregistrée au Royaume-Uni.", "Italiano": "NivaDesk è gestito da EGGCRAFT LIMITED, società registrata nel Regno Unito.", "Español (Spanish)": "NivaDesk es operado por EGGCRAFT LIMITED, una empresa registrada en el Reino Unido.", "Português": "O NivaDesk é operado pela EGGCRAFT LIMITED, uma empresa registada no Reino Unido.", "Русский (Russian)": "NivaDesk управляется компанией EGGCRAFT LIMITED, зарегистрированной в Великобритании.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "NivaDesk は英国で登録された企業 EGGCRAFT LIMITED によって運営されています。", "中文 (Chinese)": "NivaDesk 由在英国注册的公司 EGGCRAFT LIMITED 运营。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يُدار NivaDesk بواسطة EGGCRAFT LIMITED، وهي شركة مسجّلة في المملكة المتحدة.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "NivaDesk का संचालन यूनाइटेड किंगडम में पंजीकृत कंपनी EGGCRAFT LIMITED द्वारा किया जाता है।"],
    "Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage or cancel anytime in your App Store account settings.": ["Türkçe": "Abonelikler, mevcut dönemin bitiminden en az 24 saat önce iptal edilmedikçe otomatik olarak yenilenir. App Store hesap ayarlarınızdan istediğiniz zaman yönetebilir veya iptal edebilirsiniz.", "English": "Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage or cancel anytime in your App Store account settings.", "Deutsch": "Abonnements verlängern sich automatisch, sofern sie nicht mindestens 24 Stunden vor Ende des aktuellen Zeitraums gekündigt werden. Sie können sie jederzeit in Ihren App-Store-Kontoeinstellungen verwalten oder kündigen.", "Français": "Les abonnements se renouvellent automatiquement sauf annulation au moins 24 heures avant la fin de la période en cours. Vous pouvez les gérer ou les annuler à tout moment dans les paramètres de votre compte App Store.", "Italiano": "Gli abbonamenti si rinnovano automaticamente salvo cancellazione almeno 24 ore prima della fine del periodo corrente. Puoi gestirli o annullarli in qualsiasi momento nelle impostazioni del tuo account App Store.", "Español (Spanish)": "Las suscripciones se renuevan automáticamente salvo que se cancelen al menos 24 horas antes del final del período actual. Puedes gestionarlas o cancelarlas en cualquier momento en los ajustes de tu cuenta de App Store.", "Português": "As subscrições renovam automaticamente, salvo cancelamento pelo menos 24 horas antes do fim do período atual. Pode geri-las ou cancelá-las a qualquer momento nas definições da sua conta App Store.", "Русский (Russian)": "Подписки продлеваются автоматически, если не отменены не менее чем за 24 часа до конца текущего периода. Вы можете управлять ими или отменить в любое время в настройках аккаунта App Store.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "購読は、現在の期間終了の少なくとも 24 時間前に解約しない限り自動更新されます。App Store のアカウント設定でいつでも管理または解約できます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "订阅会自动续订，除非在当前周期结束前至少 24 小时取消。您可以随时在 App Store 账户设置中管理或取消。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تتجدد الاشتراكات تلقائيًا ما لم تُلغَ قبل 24 ساعة على الأقل من نهاية الفترة الحالية. يمكنك إدارتها أو إلغاؤها في أي وقت من إعدادات حساب App Store.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सदस्यताएँ स्वतः नवीनीकृत होती हैं जब तक कि मौजूदा अवधि समाप्त होने से कम से कम 24 घंटे पहले रद्द न की जाएँ। आप इन्हें अपने App Store खाता सेटिंग्स में कभी भी प्रबंधित या रद्द कर सकते हैं।"],
    "Storage add-ons": ["Türkçe": "Depolama eklentileri", "English": "Storage add-ons", "Deutsch": "Speicher-Add-ons", "Français": "Modules de stockage", "Italiano": "Componenti di archiviazione", "Español (Spanish)": "Complementos de almacenamiento", "Português": "Suplementos de armazenamento", "Русский (Russian)": "Дополнения хранилища", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ストレージアドオン", "中文 (Chinese)": "存储附加项", "العربية (Arabic)": "إضافات التخزين", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "स्टोरेज ऐड-ऑन"],
