    "Add to Calendar": ["Türkçe": "Takvime Ekle", "English": "Add to Calendar", "Deutsch": "Zum Kalender hinzufügen", "Français": "Ajouter au calendrier", "Italiano": "Aggiungi al calendario", "Español (Spanish)": "Añadir al calendario", "Português": "Adicionar ao calendário", "Русский (Russian)": "Добавить в календарь", "日本語 (Japanese)": "カレンダーに追加", "中文 (Chinese)": "添加到日历", "العربية (Arabic)": "إضافة إلى التقويم", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "कैलेंडर में जोड़ें"],
