    "Your current workspace role does not include dashboard or financial access.": ["Türkçe": "Mevcut workspace rolünüz dashboard veya finans erişimi içermiyor.", "English": "Your current workspace role does not include dashboard or financial access.", "Deutsch": "Ihre aktuelle Workspace-Rolle enthält keinen Dashboard- oder Finanzzugriff.", "Français": "Votre rôle actuel n’inclut pas l’accès au dashboard ou aux finances.", "Italiano": "Il ruolo attuale non include accesso a dashboard o finanze.", "Español (Spanish)": "Tu rol actual no incluye acceso al dashboard ni a finanzas.", "Português": "O seu papel atual não inclui acesso ao dashboard ou finanças.", "Русский (Russian)": "Ваша роль не включает доступ к панели или финансам.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "現在のロールにはダッシュボードまたは財務アクセスがありません。", "中文 (Chinese)": "当前工作区角色不包含仪表板或财务访问权限。", "العربية (Arabic)": "دورك الحالي لا يتضمن وصولاً للوحة المعلومات أو الماليات.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आपकी current workspace role में dashboard या finance access नहीं है."],
    "Your current workspace role does not include customer access.": ["Türkçe": "Mevcut workspace rolünüz müşteri erişimi içermiyor.", "English": "Your current workspace role does not include customer access.", "Deutsch": "Ihre aktuelle Workspace-Rolle enthält keinen Kundenzugriff.", "Français": "Votre rôle actuel n’inclut pas l’accès clients.", "Italiano": "Il ruolo attuale non include accesso clienti.", "Español (Spanish)": "Tu rol actual no incluye acceso a clientes.", "Português": "O seu papel atual não inclui acesso a clientes.", "Русский (Russian)": "Ваша роль не включает доступ к клиентам.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "現在のロールには顧客アクセスがありません。", "中文 (Chinese)": "当前工作区角色不包含客户访问权限。", "العربية (Arabic)": "دورك الحالي لا يتضمن وصولاً للعملاء.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आपकी current workspace role में customer access नहीं है."],
    "Your current workspace role does not include Quick Reply access.": ["Türkçe": "Mevcut workspace rolünüz Quick Reply erişimi içermiyor.", "English": "Your current workspace role does not include Quick Reply access.", "Deutsch": "Ihre aktuelle Workspace-Rolle enthält keinen Quick-Reply-Zugriff.", "Français": "Votre rôle actuel n’inclut pas l’accès Quick Reply.", "Italiano": "Il ruolo attuale non include accesso Quick Reply.", "Español (Spanish)": "Tu rol actual no incluye acceso a Quick Reply.", "Português": "O seu papel atual não inclui acesso ao Quick Reply.", "Русский (Russian)": "Ваша роль не включает доступ к Quick Reply.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "現在のロールにはQuick Replyアクセスがありません。", "中文 (Chinese)": "当前工作区角色不包含 Quick Reply 访问权限。", "العربية (Arabic)": "دورك الحالي لا يتضمن وصولاً إلى Quick Reply.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आपकी current workspace role में Quick Reply access नहीं है."],
    "Your current workspace role does not include settings access.": ["Türkçe": "Mevcut workspace rolünüz ayarlar erişimi içermiyor.", "English": "Your current workspace role does not include settings access.", "Deutsch": "Ihre aktuelle Workspace-Rolle enthält keinen Einstellungszugriff.", "Français": "Votre rôle actuel n’inclut pas l’accès aux réglages.", "Italiano": "Il ruolo attuale non include accesso impostazioni.", "Español (Spanish)": "Tu rol actual no incluye acceso a ajustes.", "Português": "O seu papel atual não inclui acesso a definições.", "Русский (Russian)": "Ваша роль не включает доступ к настройкам.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "現在のロールには設定アクセスがありません。", "中文 (Chinese)": "当前工作区角色不包含设置访问权限。", "العربية (Arabic)": "دورك الحالي لا يتضمن وصولاً للإعدادات.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आपकी current workspace role में settings access नहीं है."],
    "Drag to resize the orders list. Double-click to reset.": ["Türkçe": "Sipariş listesini genişletmek için sürükleyin. Sıfırlamak için çift tıklayın.", "English": "Drag to resize the orders list. Double-click to reset.", "Deutsch": "Ziehen, um die Bestellliste zu ändern. Doppelklick setzt zurück.", "Français": "Faites glisser pour redimensionner la liste. Double-cliquez pour réinitialiser.", "Italiano": "Trascina per ridimensionare la lista ordini. Doppio clic per ripristinare.", "Español (Spanish)": "Arrastra para cambiar el tamaño de la lista. Doble clic para restablecer.", "Português": "Arraste para redimensionar a lista. Duplo clique para repor.", "Русский (Russian)": "Перетащите, чтобы изменить список. Двойной щелчок — сброс.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ドラッグで注文リストの幅を変更。ダブルクリックでリセット。", "中文 (Chinese)": "拖动可调整订单列表大小。双击可重置。", "العربية (Arabic)": "اسحب لتغيير حجم قائمة الطلبات. انقر مرتين لإعادة الضبط.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Orders list का size बदलने के लिए drag करें। reset के लिए double-click करें."],
    "Drag to resize the customers list. Double-click to reset.": ["Türkçe": "Müşteri listesini genişletmek için sürükleyin. Sıfırlamak için çift tıklayın.", "English": "Drag to resize the customers list. Double-click to reset.", "Deutsch": "Ziehen, um die Kundenliste zu ändern. Doppelklick setzt zurück.", "Français": "Faites glisser pour redimensionner la liste clients. Double-cliquez pour réinitialiser.", "Italiano": "Trascina per ridimensionare la lista clienti. Doppio clic per ripristinare.", "Español (Spanish)": "Arrastra para cambiar el tamaño de la lista de clientes. Doble clic para restablecer.", "Português": "Arraste para redimensionar a lista de clientes. Duplo clique para repor.", "Русский (Russian)": "Перетащите, чтобы изменить список клиентов. Двойной щелчок — сброс.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ドラッグで顧客リストの幅を変更。ダブルクリックでリセット。", "中文 (Chinese)": "拖动可调整客户列表大小。双击可重置。", "العربية (Arabic)": "اسحب لتغيير حجم قائمة العملاء. انقر مرتين لإعادة الضبط.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Customers list का size बदलने के लिए drag करें। reset के लिए double-click करें."],
