    "All orders and customers will be permanently deleted.": ["Türkçe": "Tüm siparişler ve müşteriler kalıcı olarak silinecek.", "English": "All orders and customers will be permanently deleted.", "Deutsch": "Alle Bestellungen und Kunden werden dauerhaft gelöscht.", "Français": "Toutes les commandes et clients seront supprimés définitivement.", "Italiano": "Tutti gli ordini e clienti saranno eliminati definitivamente.", "Español (Spanish)": "Todos los pedidos y clientes se eliminarán permanentemente.", "Português": "Todos os pedidos e clientes serão apagados permanentemente.", "Русский (Russian)": "Все заказы и клиенты будут удалены навсегда.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "すべての注文と顧客が完全に削除されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "所有订单和客户将被永久删除。", "العربية (Arabic)": "سيتم حذف كل الطلبات والعملاء نهائياً.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सभी ऑर्डर और ग्राहक स्थायी रूप से हटेंगे."],
    "Import Backup": ["Türkçe": "Yedek İçe Aktar", "English": "Import Backup", "Deutsch": "Backup importieren", "Français": "Importer une sauvegarde", "Italiano": "Importa backup", "Español (Spanish)": "Importar copia", "Português": "Importar backup", "Русский (Russian)": "Импорт резервной копии", "日本語 (Japanese)": "バックアップをインポート", "中文 (Chinese)": "导入备份", "العربية (Arabic)": "استيراد نسخة احتياطية", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "बैकअप आयात करें"],
    "Choose Backup File": ["Türkçe": "Yedek Dosyası Seç", "English": "Choose Backup File", "Deutsch": "Backup-Datei wählen", "Français": "Choisir le fichier", "Italiano": "Scegli file backup", "Español (Spanish)": "Elegir archivo", "Português": "Escolher arquivo", "Русский (Russian)": "Выбрать файл", "日本語 (Japanese)": "バックアップファイルを選択", "中文 (Chinese)": "选择备份文件", "العربية (Arabic)": "اختيار ملف النسخ", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "बैकअप फ़ाइल चुनें"],
    "Import Finished": ["Türkçe": "İçe Aktarma Tamamlandı", "English": "Import Finished", "Deutsch": "Import abgeschlossen", "Français": "Import terminé", "Italiano": "Import completato", "Español (Spanish)": "Importación terminada", "Português": "Importação concluída", "Русский (Russian)": "Импорт завершен", "日本語 (Japanese)": "インポート完了", "中文 (Chinese)": "导入完成", "العربية (Arabic)": "اكتمل الاستيراد", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आयात पूर्ण"],
    "OK": ["Türkçe": "Tamam", "English": "OK", "Deutsch": "OK", "Français": "OK", "Italiano": "OK", "Español (Spanish)": "OK", "Português": "OK", "Русский (Russian)": "OK", "日本語 (Japanese)": "OK", "中文 (Chinese)": "确定", "العربية (Arabic)": "حسناً", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "ठीक"],
    "Create a backup before importing or deleting data.": ["Türkçe": "Veri içe aktarmadan veya silmeden önce yedek oluşturun.", "English": "Create a backup before importing or deleting data.", "Deutsch": "Erstellen Sie ein Backup vor Import oder Löschung.", "Français": "Créez une sauvegarde avant d’importer ou supprimer.", "Italiano": "Crea un backup prima di importare o eliminare.", "Español (Spanish)": "Crea una copia antes de importar o borrar.", "Português": "Crie backup antes de importar ou apagar.", "Русский (Russian)": "Создайте резервную копию перед импортом или удалением.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "インポートや削除の前にバックアップを作成してください。", "中文 (Chinese)": "导入或删除数据前请先备份。", "العربية (Arabic)": "أنشئ نسخة احتياطية قبل الاستيراد أو الحذف.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आयात या हटाने से पहले बैकअप बनाएँ."],
    "Export Backup": ["Türkçe": "Yedek Dışa Aktar", "English": "Export Backup", "Deutsch": "Backup exportieren", "Français": "Exporter sauvegarde", "Italiano": "Esporta backup", "Español (Spanish)": "Exportar copia", "Português": "Exportar backup", "Русский (Russian)": "Экспорт резервной копии", "日本語 (Japanese)": "バックアップをエクスポート", "中文 (Chinese)": "导出备份", "العربية (Arabic)": "تصدير نسخة احتياطية", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "बैकअप निर्यात"],
    "Export CSV": ["Türkçe": "CSV Dışa Aktar", "English": "Export CSV", "Deutsch": "CSV exportieren", "Français": "Exporter CSV", "Italiano": "Esporta CSV", "Español (Spanish)": "Exportar CSV", "Português": "Exportar CSV", "Русский (Russian)": "Экспорт CSV", "日本語 (Japanese)": "CSVをエクスポート", "中文 (Chinese)": "导出 CSV", "العربية (Arabic)": "تصدير CSV", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "CSV निर्यात"],
    "Delete Data": ["Türkçe": "Verileri Sil", "English": "Delete Data", "Deutsch": "Daten löschen", "Français": "Supprimer les données", "Italiano": "Elimina dati", "Español (Spanish)": "Eliminar datos", "Português": "Apagar dados", "Русский (Russian)": "Удалить данные", "日本語 (Japanese)": "データを削除", "中文 (Chinese)": "删除数据", "العربية (Arabic)": "حذف البيانات", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "डेटा हटाएँ"],
    "Type DELETE DATA to confirm": ["Türkçe": "Onaylamak için DELETE DATA yazın", "English": "Type DELETE DATA to confirm", "Deutsch": "Zum Bestätigen DELETE DATA eingeben", "Français": "Tapez DELETE DATA pour confirmer", "Italiano": "Digita DELETE DATA per confermare", "Español (Spanish)": "Escribe DELETE DATA para confirmar", "Português": "Escreva DELETE DATA para confirmar", "Русский (Russian)": "Введите DELETE DATA для подтверждения", "日本語 (Japanese)": "確認するには DELETE DATA と入力してください", "中文 (Chinese)": "输入 DELETE DATA 以确认", "العربية (Arabic)": "اكتب DELETE DATA للتأكيد", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "पुष्टि के लिए DELETE DATA लिखें"],
    "All orders and customers will be permanently deleted. Type DELETE DATA to confirm.": ["Türkçe": "Tüm siparişler ve müşteriler kalıcı olarak silinecek. Onaylamak için DELETE DATA yazın.", "English": "All orders and customers will be permanently deleted. Type DELETE DATA to confirm.", "Deutsch": "Alle Bestellungen und Kunden werden dauerhaft gelöscht. Zum Bestätigen DELETE DATA eingeben.", "Français": "Toutes les commandes et tous les clients seront définitivement supprimés. Tapez DELETE DATA pour confirmer.", "Italiano": "Tutti gli ordini e i clienti saranno eliminati definitivamente. Digita DELETE DATA per confermare.", "Español (Spanish)": "Todos los pedidos y clientes se eliminarán permanentemente. Escribe DELETE DATA para confirmar.", "Português": "Todos os pedidos e clientes serão apagados permanentemente. Escreva DELETE DATA para confirmar.", "Русский (Russian)": "Все заказы и клиенты будут удалены безвозвратно. Введите DELETE DATA для подтверждения.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "すべての注文と顧客が完全に削除されます。確認するには DELETE DATA と入力してください。", "中文 (Chinese)": "所有订单和客户将被永久删除。输入 DELETE DATA 以确认。", "العربية (Arabic)": "سيتم حذف جميع الطلبات والعملاء نهائيًا. اكتب DELETE DATA للتأكيد.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सभी ऑर्डर और ग्राहक स्थायी रूप से हटा दिए जाएंगे। पुष्टि के लिए DELETE DATA लिखें।"],
    "Export Studio Backup": ["Türkçe": "Studio Yedeğini Dışa Aktar", "English": "Export Studio Backup", "Deutsch": "Studio-Backup exportieren", "Français": "Exporter la sauvegarde studio", "Italiano": "Esporta backup studio", "Español (Spanish)": "Exportar copia del estudio", "Português": "Exportar backup do estúdio", "Русский (Russian)": "Экспорт резервной копии студии", "日本語 (Japanese)": "スタジオバックアップをエクスポート", "中文 (Chinese)": "导出工作室备份", "العربية (Arabic)": "تصدير نسخة الاستوديو", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "स्टूडियो बैकअप निर्यात"],
    "Export Orders CSV": ["Türkçe": "Sipariş CSV Dışa Aktar", "English": "Export Orders CSV", "Deutsch": "Bestellungen als CSV exportieren", "Français": "Exporter commandes CSV", "Italiano": "Esporta ordini CSV", "Español (Spanish)": "Exportar pedidos CSV", "Português": "Exportar pedidos CSV", "Русский (Russian)": "Экспорт заказов CSV", "日本語 (Japanese)": "注文CSVをエクスポート", "中文 (Chinese)": "导出订单 CSV", "العربية (Arabic)": "تصدير الطلبات CSV", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "ऑर्डर CSV निर्यात"],
    "Customers": ["Türkçe": "Müşteriler", "English": "Customers", "Deutsch": "Kunden", "Français": "Clients", "Italiano": "Clienti", "Español (Spanish)": "Clientes", "Português": "Clientes", "Русский (Russian)": "Клиенты", "日本語 (Japanese)": "顧客", "中文 (Chinese)": "客户", "العربية (Arabic)": "العملاء", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "ग्राहक"],
    "imported": ["Türkçe": "içe aktarıldı", "English": "imported", "Deutsch": "importiert", "Français": "importé", "Italiano": "importato", "Español (Spanish)": "importado", "Português": "importado", "Русский (Russian)": "импортировано", "日本語 (Japanese)": "インポート済み", "中文 (Chinese)": "已导入", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم الاستيراد", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आयात किया गया"],
    "Import failed": ["Türkçe": "İçe aktarma başarısız", "English": "Import failed", "Deutsch": "Import fehlgeschlagen", "Français": "Échec de l’import", "Italiano": "Import fallito", "Español (Spanish)": "Importación fallida", "Português": "Falha na importação", "Русский (Russian)": "Ошибка импорта", "日本語 (Japanese)": "インポート失敗", "中文 (Chinese)": "导入失败", "العربية (Arabic)": "فشل الاستيراد", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आयात विफल"],
    "This file could not be imported. Please choose a valid NivaDesk backup JSON file.": ["Türkçe": "Bu dosya içe aktarılamadı. Lütfen geçerli bir NivaDesk yedek JSON dosyası seçin.", "English": "This file could not be imported. Please choose a valid NivaDesk backup JSON file.", "Deutsch": "Diese Datei konnte nicht importiert werden. Bitte wählen Sie eine gültige NivaDesk-JSON-Backup-Datei.", "Français": "Ce fichier n’a pas pu être importé. Choisissez un fichier JSON de sauvegarde NivaDesk valide.", "Italiano": "Questo file non può essere importato. Scegli un backup JSON NivaDesk valido.", "Español (Spanish)": "No se pudo importar este archivo. Elige un JSON de copia de NivaDesk válido.", "Português": "Não foi possível importar este arquivo. Escolha um JSON de backup NivaDesk válido.", "Русский (Russian)": "Не удалось импортировать файл. Выберите действительный JSON-файл резервной копии NivaDesk.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "このファイルはインポートできません。有効なNivaDeskバックアップJSONを選択してください。", "中文 (Chinese)": "无法导入此文件。请选择有效的 NivaDesk 备份 JSON 文件。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تعذر استيراد هذا الملف. اختر ملف JSON احتياطي صالح لـ NivaDesk.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "यह फ़ाइल आयात नहीं हो सकी। कृपया मान्य NivaDesk बैकअप JSON चुनें."],
    "Profile updated.": ["Türkçe": "Profil güncellendi.", "English": "Profile updated.", "Deutsch": "Profil aktualisiert.", "Français": "Profil mis à jour.", "Italiano": "Profilo aggiornato.", "Español (Spanish)": "Perfil actualizado.", "Português": "Perfil atualizado.", "Русский (Russian)": "Профиль обновлен.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "プロフィール更新済み。", "中文 (Chinese)": "资料已更新。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم تحديث الملف.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "प्रोफ़ाइल अपडेट हुई."],
    "Profile updated. Company details can only be changed by the workspace owner.": ["Türkçe": "Profil güncellendi. Şirket bilgilerini sadece workspace sahibi değiştirebilir.", "English": "Profile updated. Company details can only be changed by the workspace owner.", "Deutsch": "Profil aktualisiert. Unternehmensdetails kann nur der Besitzer ändern.", "Français": "Profil mis à jour. Seul le propriétaire peut modifier l’entreprise.", "Italiano": "Profilo aggiornato. Solo il proprietario può cambiare l’azienda.", "Español (Spanish)": "Perfil actualizado. Solo el propietario puede cambiar la empresa.", "Português": "Perfil atualizado. Só o proprietário pode alterar a empresa.", "Русский (Russian)": "Профиль обновлен. Данные компании может менять только владелец.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "プロフィールを更新しました。会社情報はオーナーのみ変更できます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "资料已更新。公司信息仅所有者可更改。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم تحديث الملف. لا يغيّر بيانات الشركة إلا المالك.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "प्रोफ़ाइल अपडेट हुई। कंपनी विवरण केवल owner बदल सकता है."],
    "Password reset email sent to": ["Türkçe": "Şifre sıfırlama e-postası gönderildi:", "English": "Password reset email sent to", "Deutsch": "Passwort-E-Mail gesendet an", "Français": "E-mail de réinitialisation envoyé à", "Italiano": "Email reset inviata a", "Español (Spanish)": "Email de restablecimiento enviado a", "Português": "Email de redefinição enviado para", "Русский (Russian)": "Письмо сброса отправлено на", "日本語 (Japanese)": "再設定メール送信先", "中文 (Chinese)": "密码重置邮件已发送至", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم إرسال بريد إعادة التعيين إلى", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "पासवर्ड रीसेट ईमेल भेजा गया"],
    "Team member added. They will now see this workspace in Available Workspaces after refreshing.": ["Türkçe": "Ekip üyesi eklendi. Yeniledikten sonra bu workspace’i görecek.", "English": "Team member added. They will now see this workspace in Available Workspaces after refreshing.", "Deutsch": "Teammitglied hinzugefügt. Nach Aktualisierung sieht es diesen Arbeitsbereich.", "Français": "Membre ajouté. Il verra cet espace après actualisation.", "Italiano": "Membro aggiunto. Vedrà il workspace dopo aggiornamento.", "Español (Spanish)": "Miembro añadido. Verá el espacio tras actualizar.", "Português": "Membro adicionado. Verá o workspace após atualizar.", "Русский (Russian)": "Участник добавлен. Он увидит область после обновления.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "メンバーを追加しました。更新後に表示されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "成员已添加，刷新后可看到该工作区。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تمت إضافة العضو. سيظهر له بعد التحديث.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सदस्य जोड़ा गया। रीफ़्रेश के बाद वर्कस्पेस दिखेगा."],
    "Team role updated.": ["Türkçe": "Ekip rolü güncellendi.", "English": "Team role updated.", "Deutsch": "Teamrolle aktualisiert.", "Français": "Rôle mis à jour.", "Italiano": "Ruolo aggiornato.", "Español (Spanish)": "Rol actualizado.", "Português": "Função atualizada.", "Русский (Russian)": "Роль обновлена.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ロールを更新しました。", "中文 (Chinese)": "角色已更新。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم تحديث الدور.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "भूमिका अपडेट हुई."],
    "Team member removed.": ["Türkçe": "Ekip üyesi kaldırıldı.", "English": "Team member removed.", "Deutsch": "Teammitglied entfernt.", "Français": "Membre supprimé.", "Italiano": "Membro rimosso.", "Español (Spanish)": "Miembro eliminado.", "Português": "Membro removido.", "Русский (Russian)": "Участник удален.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "メンバーを削除しました。", "中文 (Chinese)": "成员已移除。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تمت إزالة العضو.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सदस्य हटाया गया."],
    "Access request sent. The workspace owner can approve it from Team Access.": ["Türkçe": "Erişim isteği gönderildi. Workspace sahibi Team Access ekranından onaylayabilir.", "English": "Access request sent. The workspace owner can approve it from Team Access.", "Deutsch": "Anfrage gesendet. Der Besitzer kann sie unter Team Access genehmigen.", "Français": "Demande envoyée. Le propriétaire peut l’approuver depuis Team Access.", "Italiano": "Richiesta inviata. Il proprietario può approvarla da Team Access.", "Español (Spanish)": "Solicitud enviada. El propietario puede aprobarla desde Team Access.", "Português": "Pedido enviado. O proprietário pode aprovar em Team Access.", "Русский (Russian)": "Запрос отправлен. Владелец может одобрить его в Team Access.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "リクエストを送信しました。オーナーは Team Access から承認できます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "访问请求已发送。所有者可在 Team Access 中批准。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم إرسال طلب الوصول. يمكن للمالك الموافقة عليه من Team Access.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "एक्सेस अनुरोध भेजा गया। Workspace owner इसे Team Access से approve कर सकता है."],
    "Access request sent. The workspace owner can approve it from their Account screen.": ["Türkçe": "Erişim isteği gönderildi. Workspace sahibi Account ekranından onaylayabilir.", "English": "Access request sent. The workspace owner can approve it from their Account screen.", "Deutsch": "Anfrage gesendet. Der Besitzer kann sie im Konto genehmigen.", "Français": "Demande envoyée. Le propriétaire peut l’approuver depuis Compte.", "Italiano": "Richiesta inviata. Il proprietario può approvarla dall’account.", "Español (Spanish)": "Solicitud enviada. El propietario puede aprobarla en Cuenta.", "Português": "Pedido enviado. O proprietário pode aprovar na Conta.", "Русский (Russian)": "Запрос отправлен. Владелец может одобрить в аккаунте.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "リクエスト送信済み。オーナーがアカウント画面で承認できます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "请求已发送。所有者可在账户页批准。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم إرسال الطلب. يمكن للمالك الموافقة من الحساب.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अनुरोध भेजा गया। Owner Account स्क्रीन से मंज़ूर कर सकता है."],
    "Access request approved. The user will now see this workspace in Available Workspaces.": ["Türkçe": "Erişim isteği onaylandı. Kullanıcı bu workspace’i Available Workspaces içinde görecek.", "English": "Access request approved. The user will now see this workspace in Available Workspaces.", "Deutsch": "Anfrage genehmigt. Der Benutzer sieht den Arbeitsbereich.", "Français": "Demande approuvée. L’utilisateur verra cet espace.", "Italiano": "Richiesta approvata. L’utente vedrà questo workspace.", "Español (Spanish)": "Solicitud aprobada. El usuario verá este espacio.", "Português": "Pedido aprovado. O usuário verá este workspace.", "Русский (Russian)": "Запрос одобрен. Пользователь увидит область.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "承認済み。ユーザーに表示されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "请求已批准，用户会看到该工作区。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تمت الموافقة وسيظهر للمستخدم.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अनुरोध स्वीकृत। उपयोगकर्ता वर्कस्पेस देखेगा."],
    "Access request declined.": ["Türkçe": "Erişim isteği reddedildi.", "English": "Access request declined.", "Deutsch": "Anfrage abgelehnt.", "Français": "Demande refusée.", "Italiano": "Richiesta rifiutata.", "Español (Spanish)": "Solicitud rechazada.", "Português": "Pedido recusado.", "Русский (Russian)": "Запрос отклонен.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "リクエストを拒否しました。", "中文 (Chinese)": "请求已拒绝。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم رفض الطلب.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अनुरोध अस्वीकृत."],
    "This workspace is workflow-only for your account. You can follow order progress, but prices, dashboard and editing tools are hidden.": ["Türkçe": "Bu workspace hesabınız için sadece iş akışı modunda. Sipariş ilerlemesini görebilirsiniz; fiyatlar, dashboard ve düzenleme araçları gizlidir.", "English": "This workspace is workflow-only for your account. You can follow order progress, but prices, dashboard and editing tools are hidden.", "Deutsch": "Dieser Arbeitsbereich ist nur für Workflow. Preise, Dashboard und Bearbeitung sind ausgeblendet.", "Français": "Cet espace est limité au flux. Prix, tableau de bord et édition sont masqués.", "Italiano": "Questo workspace è solo workflow. Prezzi, dashboard e modifica sono nascosti.", "Español (Spanish)": "Este espacio es solo flujo. Precios, panel y edición están ocultos.", "Português": "Este workspace é apenas workflow. Preços, painel e edição ficam ocultos.", "Русский (Russian)": "Эта область только для процесса. Цены, панель и редактирование скрыты.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "このワークスペースは進行確認のみです。価格、ダッシュボード、編集は非表示です。", "中文 (Chinese)": "此工作区仅用于流程查看，价格、仪表板和编辑工具已隐藏。", "العربية (Arabic)": "هذه المساحة لسير العمل فقط. الأسعار واللوحة وأدوات التحرير مخفية.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "यह वर्कस्पेस केवल वर्कफ़्लो के लिए है। कीमतें, डैशबोर्ड और संपादन छिपे हैं."],
    "This workspace is view-only for your account. You can review orders and customer information, but saving changes may be blocked by the workspace permissions.": ["Türkçe": "Bu workspace hesabınız için sadece görüntüleme modunda. Sipariş ve müşteri bilgilerini görebilirsiniz; değişiklik kaydı izinlerle engellenebilir.", "English": "This workspace is view-only for your account. You can review orders and customer information, but saving changes may be blocked by the workspace permissions.", "Deutsch": "Dieser Arbeitsbereich ist nur zum Ansehen. Speichern kann blockiert sein.", "Français": "Cet espace est en lecture seule. L’enregistrement peut être bloqué.", "Italiano": "Questo workspace è in sola lettura. Il salvataggio può essere bloccato.", "Español (Spanish)": "Este espacio es de solo lectura. Guardar puede estar bloqueado.", "Português": "Este workspace é só visualização. Salvar pode ser bloqueado.", "Русский (Russian)": "Эта область только для просмотра. Сохранение может быть заблокировано.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "このワークスペースは閲覧専用です。保存は権限で制限されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "此工作区为仅查看，保存可能被权限阻止。", "العربية (Arabic)": "هذه المساحة للعرض فقط. قد يتم منع الحفظ.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "यह वर्कस्पेस केवल देखने के लिए है। सेव करना अनुमति से रुक सकता है."],
    "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.": ["Türkçe": "İlk siparişinizi oluşturun veya NivaDesk’un iş akışı adımları, alanlar ve etiketleri hazırlaması için iş kurulumunu tekrar çalıştırın.", "English": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "Deutsch": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "Français": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "Italiano": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "Español (Spanish)": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "Português": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "Русский (Russian)": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "中文 (Chinese)": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "العربية (Arabic)": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you."],
    "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.": ["Türkçe": "Önce işletme türünüzü seçin. NivaDesk ilk siparişten önce iş akışı adımları, alanlar, kart etiketleri ve durumları hazırlayabilir.", "English": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "Deutsch": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "Français": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "Italiano": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "Español (Spanish)": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "Português": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "Русский (Russian)": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "中文 (Chinese)": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "العربية (Arabic)": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order."],
    "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.": ["Türkçe": "İşinizin nasıl ilerlediğini, müşteriden hangi bilgileri aldığınızı, onay, malzeme, randevu, depozito, kargo veya teslimat adımlarını yazabilirsiniz. Boş bırakırsanız seçili işletme türünün standart şablonu kullanılır.", "English": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "Deutsch": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "Français": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "Italiano": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "Español (Spanish)": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "Português": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "Русский (Russian)": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "中文 (Chinese)": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "العربية (Arabic)": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type."],
    "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.": ["Türkçe": "Örnek: Kişiye özel boyalı saat kadranları yapıyoruz. Saat modeli, kadran ölçüsü, tema, müşteri onayı, depozito, boyama, kuruma, final fotoğraflar ve kargo gerekiyor.", "English": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "Deutsch": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "Français": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "Italiano": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "Español (Spanish)": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "Português": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "Русский (Russian)": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "中文 (Chinese)": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "العربية (Arabic)": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping."],
    "You can change this later from Settings > Workflow > Business Type.": ["Türkçe": "Bunu daha sonra Settings > Workflow > Business Type içinden değiştirebilirsiniz.", "English": "You can change this later from Settings > Workflow > Business Type.", "Deutsch": "You can change this later from Settings > Workflow > Business Type.", "Français": "You can change this later from Settings > Workflow > Business Type.", "Italiano": "You can change this later from Settings > Workflow > Business Type.", "Español (Spanish)": "You can change this later from Settings > Workflow > Business Type.", "Português": "You can change this later from Settings > Workflow > Business Type.", "Русский (Russian)": "You can change this later from Settings > Workflow > Business Type.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "You can change this later from Settings > Workflow > Business Type.", "中文 (Chinese)": "You can change this later from Settings > Workflow > Business Type.", "العربية (Arabic)": "You can change this later from Settings > Workflow > Business Type.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "You can change this later from Settings > Workflow > Business Type."],
    "Manage your NivaDesk profile, company details and sign-in security.": ["Türkçe": "NivaDesk profilinizi, şirket bilgilerinizi ve giriş güvenliğinizi yönetin.", "English": "Manage your NivaDesk profile, company details and sign-in security.", "Deutsch": "Manage your NivaDesk profile, company details and sign-in security.", "Français": "Manage your NivaDesk profile, company details and sign-in security.", "Italiano": "Manage your NivaDesk profile, company details and sign-in security.", "Español (Spanish)": "Manage your NivaDesk profile, company details and sign-in security.", "Português": "Manage your NivaDesk profile, company details and sign-in security.", "Русский (Russian)": "Manage your NivaDesk profile, company details and sign-in security.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Manage your NivaDesk profile, company details and sign-in security.", "中文 (Chinese)": "Manage your NivaDesk profile, company details and sign-in security.", "العربية (Arabic)": "Manage your NivaDesk profile, company details and sign-in security.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Manage your NivaDesk profile, company details and sign-in security."],
    "Password changes are handled securely by Firebase. We send a reset link to your account email instead of storing or editing your password inside the app.": ["Türkçe": "Şifre değişiklikleri Firebase tarafından güvenli şekilde yapılır. Şifreyi uygulama içinde saklamak veya düzenlemek yerine hesabınıza sıfırlama linki göndeririz.", "English": "Password changes are handled securely by Firebase. We send a reset link to your account email instead of storing or editing your password inside the app.", "Deutsch": "Password changes are handled securely by Firebase. We send a reset link to your account email instead of storing or editing your password inside the app.", "Français": "Password changes are handled securely by Firebase. We send a reset link to your account email instead of storing or editing your password inside the app.", "Italiano": "Password changes are handled securely by Firebase. We send a reset link to your account email instead of storing or editing your password inside the app.", "Español (Spanish)": "Password changes are handled securely by Firebase. We send a reset link to your account email instead of storing or editing your password inside the app.", "Português": "Password changes are handled securely by Firebase. We send a reset link to your account email instead of storing or editing your password inside the app.", "Русский (Russian)": "Password changes are handled securely by Firebase. We send a reset link to your account email instead of storing or editing your password inside the app.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Password changes are handled securely by Firebase. We send a reset link to your account email instead of storing or editing your password inside the app.", "中文 (Chinese)": "Password changes are handled securely by Firebase. We send a reset link to your account email instead of storing or editing your password inside the app.", "العربية (Arabic)": "Password changes are handled securely by Firebase. We send a reset link to your account email instead of storing or editing your password inside the app.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Password changes are handled securely by Firebase. We send a reset link to your account email instead of storing or editing your password inside the app."],
    "You can sign back in with your email and password.": ["Türkçe": "E-posta ve şifrenizle tekrar giriş yapabilirsiniz.", "English": "You can sign back in with your email and password.", "Deutsch": "You can sign back in with your email and password.", "Français": "You can sign back in with your email and password.", "Italiano": "You can sign back in with your email and password.", "Español (Spanish)": "You can sign back in with your email and password.", "Português": "You can sign back in with your email and password.", "Русский (Russian)": "You can sign back in with your email and password.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "You can sign back in with your email and password.", "中文 (Chinese)": "You can sign back in with your email and password.", "العربية (Arabic)": "You can sign back in with your email and password.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "You can sign back in with your email and password."],
    "Share your Company ID with the person you want to invite. They will send a request from their Account screen, then you can approve it here.": ["Türkçe": "Davet etmek istediğiniz kişiyle Company ID’nizi paylaşın. Kendi Account ekranından istek gönderecek, siz de buradan onaylayacaksınız.", "English": "Share your Company ID with the person you want to invite. They will send a request from their Account screen, then you can approve it here.", "Deutsch": "Share your Company ID with the person you want to invite. They will send a request from their Account screen, then you can approve it here.", "Français": "Share your Company ID with the person you want to invite. They will send a request from their Account screen, then you can approve it here.", "Italiano": "Share your Company ID with the person you want to invite. They will send a request from their Account screen, then you can approve it here.", "Español (Spanish)": "Share your Company ID with the person you want to invite. They will send a request from their Account screen, then you can approve it here.", "Português": "Share your Company ID with the person you want to invite. They will send a request from their Account screen, then you can approve it here.", "Русский (Russian)": "Share your Company ID with the person you want to invite. They will send a request from their Account screen, then you can approve it here.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Share your Company ID with the person you want to invite. They will send a request from their Account screen, then you can approve it here.", "中文 (Chinese)": "Share your Company ID with the person you want to invite. They will send a request from their Account screen, then you can approve it here.", "العربية (Arabic)": "Share your Company ID with the person you want to invite. They will send a request from their Account screen, then you can approve it here.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Share your Company ID with the person you want to invite. They will send a request from their Account screen, then you can approve it here."],
    "Approved workspaces will appear here.": ["Türkçe": "Onaylanan workspace’ler burada görünür.", "English": "Approved workspaces will appear here.", "Deutsch": "Approved workspaces will appear here.", "Français": "Approved workspaces will appear here.", "Italiano": "Approved workspaces will appear here.", "Español (Spanish)": "Approved workspaces will appear here.", "Português": "Approved workspaces will appear here.", "Русский (Russian)": "Approved workspaces will appear here.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Approved workspaces will appear here.", "中文 (Chinese)": "Approved workspaces will appear here.", "العربية (Arabic)": "Approved workspaces will appear here.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Approved workspaces will appear here."],
    "Use this only if the owner has already approved your account and the workspace does not appear above.": ["Türkçe": "Bunu sadece owner hesabınızı onayladıysa ve workspace yukarıda görünmüyorsa kullanın.", "English": "Use this only if the owner has already approved your account and the workspace does not appear above.", "Deutsch": "Use this only if the owner has already approved your account and the workspace does not appear above.", "Français": "Use this only if the owner has already approved your account and the workspace does not appear above.", "Italiano": "Use this only if the owner has already approved your account and the workspace does not appear above.", "Español (Spanish)": "Use this only if the owner has already approved your account and the workspace does not appear above.", "Português": "Use this only if the owner has already approved your account and the workspace does not appear above.", "Русский (Russian)": "Use this only if the owner has already approved your account and the workspace does not appear above.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Use this only if the owner has already approved your account and the workspace does not appear above.", "中文 (Chinese)": "Use this only if the owner has already approved your account and the workspace does not appear above.", "العربية (Arabic)": "Use this only if the owner has already approved your account and the workspace does not appear above.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Use this only if the owner has already approved your account and the workspace does not appear above."],
    "Enter the owner’s Company ID and send a request.": ["Türkçe": "Owner’ın Company ID’sini girip istek gönderin.", "English": "Enter the owner’s Company ID and send a request.", "Deutsch": "Enter the owner’s Company ID and send a request.", "Français": "Enter the owner’s Company ID and send a request.", "Italiano": "Enter the owner’s Company ID and send a request.", "Español (Spanish)": "Enter the owner’s Company ID and send a request.", "Português": "Enter the owner’s Company ID and send a request.", "Русский (Russian)": "Enter the owner’s Company ID and send a request.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Enter the owner’s Company ID and send a request.", "中文 (Chinese)": "Enter the owner’s Company ID and send a request.", "العربية (Arabic)": "Enter the owner’s Company ID and send a request.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Enter the owner’s Company ID and send a request."],
    "Only the workspace owner can change team access.": ["Türkçe": "Ekip erişimini sadece workspace sahibi değiştirebilir.", "English": "Only the workspace owner can change team access.", "Deutsch": "Only the workspace owner can change team access.", "Français": "Only the workspace owner can change team access.", "Italiano": "Only the workspace owner can change team access.", "Español (Spanish)": "Only the workspace owner can change team access.", "Português": "Only the workspace owner can change team access.", "Русский (Russian)": "Only the workspace owner can change team access.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Only the workspace owner can change team access.", "中文 (Chinese)": "Only the workspace owner can change team access.", "العربية (Arabic)": "Only the workspace owner can change team access.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Only the workspace owner can change team access."],
