    "After 1 minute": ["Türkçe": "1 dakika sonra", "English": "After 1 minute", "Deutsch": "Nach 1 Minute", "Français": "Après 1 minute", "Italiano": "Dopo 1 minuto", "Español (Spanish)": "Después de 1 minuto", "Português": "Após 1 minuto", "Русский (Russian)": "Через 1 минуту", "日本語 (Japanese)": "1分後", "中文 (Chinese)": "1 分钟后", "العربية (Arabic)": "بعد دقيقة واحدة", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "1 मिनट बाद"],
    "After 5 minutes": ["Türkçe": "5 dakika sonra", "English": "After 5 minutes", "Deutsch": "Nach 5 Minuten", "Français": "Après 5 minutes", "Italiano": "Dopo 5 minuti", "Español (Spanish)": "Después de 5 minutos", "Português": "Após 5 minutos", "Русский (Russian)": "Через 5 минут", "日本語 (Japanese)": "5分後", "中文 (Chinese)": "5 分钟后", "العربية (Arabic)": "بعد 5 دقائق", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "5 मिनट बाद"],
    "After 15 minutes": ["Türkçe": "15 dakika sonra", "English": "After 15 minutes", "Deutsch": "Nach 15 Minuten", "Français": "Après 15 minutes", "Italiano": "Dopo 15 minuti", "Español (Spanish)": "Después de 15 minutos", "Português": "Após 15 minutos", "Русский (Russian)": "Через 15 минут", "日本語 (Japanese)": "15分後", "中文 (Chinese)": "15 分钟后", "العربية (Arabic)": "بعد 15 دقيقة", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "15 मिनट बाद"],
    "After 1 hour": ["Türkçe": "1 saat sonra", "English": "After 1 hour", "Deutsch": "Nach 1 Stunde", "Français": "Après 1 heure", "Italiano": "Dopo 1 ora", "Español (Spanish)": "Después de 1 hora", "Português": "Após 1 hora", "Русский (Russian)": "Через 1 час", "日本語 (Japanese)": "1時間後", "中文 (Chinese)": "1 小时后", "العربية (Arabic)": "بعد ساعة واحدة", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "1 घंटे बाद"],
    "Choose how long NivaDesk can stay in the background before it asks to unlock again.": ["Türkçe": "NivaDesk'in tekrar kilit açma istemeden önce arka planda ne kadar kalabileceğini seçin.", "English": "Choose how long NivaDesk can stay in the background before it asks to unlock again.", "Deutsch": "Wählen Sie, wie lange NivaDesk im Hintergrund bleiben darf, bevor es erneut zum Entsperren auffordert.", "Français": "Choisissez combien de temps NivaDesk peut rester en arrière-plan avant de redemander le déverrouillage.", "Italiano": "Scegli per quanto tempo NivaDesk può restare in background prima di richiedere di nuovo lo sblocco.", "Español (Spanish)": "Elige cuánto tiempo puede permanecer NivaDesk en segundo plano antes de volver a pedir el desbloqueo.", "Português": "Escolha quanto tempo o NivaDesk pode ficar em segundo plano antes de pedir o desbloqueio novamente.", "Русский (Russian)": "Выберите, как долго NivaDesk может оставаться в фоне, прежде чем снова запросить разблокировку.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "再ロック解除を求める前に NivaDesk がバックグラウンドに留まれる時間を選択します。", "中文 (Chinese)": "选择 NivaDesk 在后台停留多久后再次要求解锁。", "العربية (Arabic)": "اختر المدة التي يمكن أن يبقى فيها NivaDesk في الخلفية قبل أن يطلب إلغاء القفل مرة أخرى.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "चुनें कि दोबारा अनलॉक माँगने से पहले NivaDesk कितनी देर बैकग्राउंड में रह सकता है।"],
    "When enabled, NivaDesk asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your device passcode whenever the app opens with an existing session.": ["Türkçe": "Açıkken, mevcut oturumla uygulama her açıldığında NivaDesk Face ID, Touch ID veya cihaz şifresi ister.", "English": "When enabled, NivaDesk asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your device passcode whenever the app opens with an existing session.", "Deutsch": "When enabled, NivaDesk asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your device passcode whenever the app opens with an existing session.", "Français": "When enabled, NivaDesk asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your device passcode whenever the app opens with an existing session.", "Italiano": "When enabled, NivaDesk asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your device passcode whenever the app opens with an existing session.", "Español (Spanish)": "When enabled, NivaDesk asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your device passcode whenever the app opens with an existing session.", "Português": "When enabled, NivaDesk asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your device passcode whenever the app opens with an existing session.", "Русский (Russian)": "When enabled, NivaDesk asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your device passcode whenever the app opens with an existing session.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "When enabled, NivaDesk asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your device passcode whenever the app opens with an existing session.", "中文 (Chinese)": "When enabled, NivaDesk asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your device passcode whenever the app opens with an existing session.", "العربية (Arabic)": "When enabled, NivaDesk asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your device passcode whenever the app opens with an existing session.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "When enabled, NivaDesk asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your device passcode whenever the app opens with an existing session."],
    "Face ID / device passcode unlock enabled.": ["Türkçe": "Face ID / cihaz şifresi kilidi açıldı.", "English": "Face ID / device passcode unlock enabled.", "Deutsch": "Face ID / Gerätecode-Entsperrung aktiviert.", "Français": "Déverrouillage Face ID / code de l’appareil activé.", "Italiano": "Sblocco Face ID / codice dispositivo attivato.", "Español (Spanish)": "Desbloqueo con Face ID / código del dispositivo activado.", "Português": "Desbloqueio com Face ID / código do dispositivo ativado.", "Русский (Russian)": "Разблокировка Face ID / кодом устройства включена.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Face ID / デバイスパスコード解除が有効です。", "中文 (Chinese)": "Face ID / 设备密码解锁已启用。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم تفعيل فتح القفل عبر Face ID / رمز الجهاز.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Face ID / डिवाइस पासकोड अनलॉक चालू है."],
    "Face ID / device passcode unlock disabled.": ["Türkçe": "Face ID / cihaz şifresi kilidi kapatıldı.", "English": "Face ID / device passcode unlock disabled.", "Deutsch": "Face ID / Gerätecode-Entsperrung deaktiviert.", "Français": "Déverrouillage Face ID / code de l’appareil désactivé.", "Italiano": "Sblocco Face ID / codice dispositivo disattivato.", "Español (Spanish)": "Desbloqueo con Face ID / código del dispositivo desactivado.", "Português": "Desbloqueio com Face ID / código do dispositivo desativado.", "Русский (Russian)": "Разблокировка Face ID / кодом устройства отключена.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Face ID / デバイスパスコード解除が無効です。", "中文 (Chinese)": "Face ID / 设备密码解锁已关闭。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم إيقاف فتح القفل عبر Face ID / رمز الجهاز.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Face ID / डिवाइस पासकोड अनलॉक बंद है."],

    "WooCommerce Integration": ["Türkçe": "WooCommerce Entegrasyonu", "English": "WooCommerce Integration", "Deutsch": "WooCommerce-Integration", "Français": "Intégration WooCommerce", "Italiano": "Integrazione WooCommerce", "Español (Spanish)": "Integración WooCommerce", "Português": "Integração WooCommerce", "Русский (Russian)": "Интеграция WooCommerce", "日本語 (Japanese)": "WooCommerce連携", "中文 (Chinese)": "WooCommerce 集成", "العربية (Arabic)": "تكامل WooCommerce", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "WooCommerce इंटीग्रेशन"],
    "Connect WooCommerce": ["Türkçe": "WooCommerce Bağlantısı", "English": "Connect WooCommerce", "Deutsch": "WooCommerce verbinden", "Français": "Connecter WooCommerce", "Italiano": "Collega WooCommerce", "Español (Spanish)": "Conectar WooCommerce", "Português": "Ligar WooCommerce", "Русский (Russian)": "Подключить WooCommerce", "日本語 (Japanese)": "WooCommerceを接続", "中文 (Chinese)": "连接 WooCommerce", "العربية (Arabic)": "ربط WooCommerce", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "WooCommerce जोड़ें"],
    "This setup only needs to be done once in WooCommerce.": ["Türkçe": "Bu kurulum WooCommerce içinde sadece bir kez yapılır.", "English": "This setup only needs to be done once in WooCommerce.", "Deutsch": "Diese Einrichtung muss nur einmal in WooCommerce erfolgen.", "Français": "Cette configuration ne doit être faite qu’une seule fois dans WooCommerce.", "Italiano": "Questa configurazione va fatta una sola volta in WooCommerce.", "Español (Spanish)": "Esta configuración solo debe hacerse una vez en WooCommerce.", "Português": "Esta configuração só precisa de ser feita uma vez no WooCommerce.", "Русский (Russian)": "Эту настройку нужно выполнить в WooCommerce только один раз.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "この設定はWooCommerceで一度だけ行えば十分です。", "中文 (Chinese)": "此设置只需在 WooCommerce 中完成一次。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يلزم إجراء هذا الإعداد مرة واحدة فقط داخل WooCommerce.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "यह सेटअप WooCommerce में सिर्फ एक बार करना होगा."],
    "To activate this connection, create one WooCommerce webhook and paste the Delivery URL below. After that, new website orders will appear in this workspace automatically.": ["Türkçe": "Bu bağlantıyı aktif etmek için WooCommerce içinde bir webhook oluşturup aşağıdaki Delivery URL adresini yapıştırın. Sonrasında yeni web sitesi siparişleri bu workspace içinde otomatik görünür.", "English": "To activate this connection, create one WooCommerce webhook and paste the Delivery URL below. After that, new website orders will appear in this workspace automatically.", "Deutsch": "Um diese Verbindung zu aktivieren, erstellen Sie einen WooCommerce-Webhook und fügen Sie die Delivery URL unten ein. Danach erscheinen neue Website-Bestellungen automatisch in diesem Workspace.", "Français": "Pour activer cette connexion, créez un webhook WooCommerce et collez la Delivery URL ci-dessous. Ensuite, les nouvelles commandes du site apparaîtront automatiquement dans cet espace.", "Italiano": "Per attivare la connessione, crea un webhook WooCommerce e incolla la Delivery URL qui sotto. Poi i nuovi ordini del sito appariranno automaticamente in questo workspace.", "Español (Spanish)": "Para activar esta conexión, crea un webhook de WooCommerce y pega la Delivery URL de abajo. Después, los nuevos pedidos web aparecerán automáticamente en este espacio.", "Português": "Para ativar esta ligação, crie um webhook WooCommerce e cole a Delivery URL abaixo. Depois, as novas encomendas do site aparecem automaticamente neste workspace.", "Русский (Russian)": "Чтобы активировать подключение, создайте webhook WooCommerce и вставьте Delivery URL ниже. После этого новые заказы сайта будут автоматически появляться в этом рабочем пространстве.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "この接続を有効にするには、WooCommerceでwebhookを1つ作成し、下のDelivery URLを貼り付けます。その後、新しいサイト注文がこのワークスペースに自動表示されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "要启用此连接，请在 WooCommerce 中创建一个 webhook，并粘贴下面的 Delivery URL。之后，新的网站订单会自动出现在此工作区。", "العربية (Arabic)": "لتفعيل هذا الاتصال، أنشئ webhook واحداً في WooCommerce والصق Delivery URL أدناه. بعد ذلك ستظهر طلبات الموقع الجديدة تلقائياً داخل مساحة العمل هذه.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "इस कनेक्शन को सक्रिय करने के लिए WooCommerce में एक webhook बनाएं और नीचे वाला Delivery URL पेस्ट करें। इसके बाद नए वेबसाइट ऑर्डर इस workspace में अपने आप दिखेंगे."],
    "Company ID is not available yet. Sign in or reconnect your workspace first.": ["Türkçe": "Company ID henüz hazır değil. Önce giriş yapın veya workspace bağlantısını tekrar kurun.", "English": "Company ID is not available yet. Sign in or reconnect your workspace first.", "Deutsch": "Die Company ID ist noch nicht verfügbar. Melden Sie sich zuerst an oder verbinden Sie den Workspace erneut.", "Français": "Le Company ID n’est pas encore disponible. Connectez-vous ou reconnectez d’abord votre espace.", "Italiano": "Il Company ID non è ancora disponibile. Accedi o ricollega prima il workspace.", "Español (Spanish)": "El Company ID aún no está disponible. Inicia sesión o vuelve a conectar el espacio primero.", "Português": "O Company ID ainda não está disponível. Inicie sessão ou volte a ligar o workspace primeiro.", "Русский (Russian)": "Company ID пока недоступен. Сначала войдите или переподключите рабочее пространство.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Company IDはまだ利用できません。先にログインするかワークスペースを再接続してください。", "中文 (Chinese)": "Company ID 尚不可用。请先登录或重新连接工作区。", "العربية (Arabic)": "معرّف الشركة غير متاح بعد. سجّل الدخول أو أعد ربط مساحة العمل أولاً.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Company ID अभी उपलब्ध नहीं है। पहले साइन इन करें या workspace फिर से जोड़ें."],
    "Copy Setup Details": ["Türkçe": "Kurulum Bilgilerini Kopyala", "English": "Copy Setup Details", "Deutsch": "Einrichtungsdaten kopieren", "Français": "Copier les informations de configuration", "Italiano": "Copia dettagli di configurazione", "Español (Spanish)": "Copiar datos de configuración", "Português": "Copiar dados de configuração", "Русский (Russian)": "Скопировать данные настройки", "日本語 (Japanese)": "設定情報をコピー", "中文 (Chinese)": "复制设置详情", "العربية (Arabic)": "نسخ تفاصيل الإعداد", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सेटअप विवरण कॉपी करें"],
    "Your Company ID": ["Türkçe": "Company ID’niz", "English": "Your Company ID", "Deutsch": "Ihre Company ID", "Français": "Votre Company ID", "Italiano": "Il tuo Company ID", "Español (Spanish)": "Tu Company ID", "Português": "O seu Company ID", "Русский (Russian)": "Ваш Company ID", "日本語 (Japanese)": "あなたのCompany ID", "中文 (Chinese)": "您的 Company ID", "العربية (Arabic)": "معرّف شركتك", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आपका Company ID"],
    "Delivery URL with Company ID": ["Türkçe": "Company ID eklenmiş Delivery URL", "English": "Delivery URL with Company ID", "Deutsch": "Delivery URL mit Company ID", "Français": "Delivery URL avec Company ID", "Italiano": "Delivery URL con Company ID", "Español (Spanish)": "Delivery URL con Company ID", "Português": "Delivery URL com Company ID", "Русский (Russian)": "Delivery URL с Company ID", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Company ID付きDelivery URL", "中文 (Chinese)": "带 Company ID 的 Delivery URL", "العربية (Arabic)": "رابط Delivery URL مع معرّف الشركة", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Company ID वाला Delivery URL"],
