    "Please add Products/Services in Settings.": ["Türkçe": "Lütfen Ayarlar'dan Ürün/Hizmet ekle.", "English": "Please add Products/Services in Settings.", "Deutsch": "Bitte Produkte/Dienste in den Einstellungen hinzufügen.", "Français": "Veuillez ajouter Produits/Services dans Paramètres.", "Italiano": "Aggiungi Prodotti/Servizi nelle Impostazioni.", "Español (Spanish)": "Añade Productos/Servicios en Ajustes.", "Português": "Adiciona Produtos/Serviços nas Definições.", "Русский (Russian)": "Добавьте продукты/услуги в настройках.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "設定で製品/サービスを追加してください。", "中文 (Chinese)": "请在设置中添加产品/服务。", "العربية (Arabic)": "أضف منتجات/خدمات من الإعدادات.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "कृपया सेटिंग्स में उत्पाद/सेवा जोड़ें।"],
    "Tip: Include as much context as possible for the best reply.": ["Türkçe": "İpucu: En iyi yanıt için mümkün olduğunca çok bağlam ekle.", "English": "Tip: Include as much context as possible for the best reply.", "Deutsch": "Tipp: So viel Kontext wie möglich für die beste Antwort einfügen.", "Français": "Astuce : ajoutez autant de contexte que possible.", "Italiano": "Suggerimento: includi più contesto possibile.", "Español (Spanish)": "Consejo: incluye todo el contexto posible.", "Português": "Dica: inclui o máximo de contexto possível.", "Русский (Russian)": "Совет: добавьте максимум контекста.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ヒント：最良の返信のためできるだけ多くのコンテキストを含めて。", "中文 (Chinese)": "提示：尽可能包含更多上下文以获得最佳回复。", "العربية (Arabic)": "نصيحة: أضف أكبر قدر من السياق للحصول على أفضل رد.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सुझाव: सर्वोत्तम उत्तर के लिए अधिकतम संदर्भ शामिल करें।"],
    "Paste the customer's email or message here...": ["Türkçe": "Müşterinin e-postasını veya mesajını buraya yapıştır...", "English": "Paste the customer's email or message here...", "Deutsch": "E-Mail oder Nachricht des Kunden hier einfügen...", "Français": "Collez ici l'e-mail ou le message du client...", "Italiano": "Incolla qui l'email o il messaggio del cliente...", "Español (Spanish)": "Pega aquí el correo o mensaje del cliente...", "Português": "Cola aqui o e-mail ou mensagem do cliente...", "Русский (Russian)": "Вставьте сюда письмо или сообщение клиента...", "日本語 (Japanese)": "顧客のメールやメッセージをここに貼り付け...", "中文 (Chinese)": "在此粘贴客户的邮件或消息...", "العربية (Arabic)": "ألصق بريد العميل أو رسالته هنا...", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "ग्राहक का ईमेल या संदेश यहाँ चिपकाएँ..."],
    "Your AI-generated reply will appear here. Review and copy with one click.": ["Türkçe": "AI yanıtın burada görünecek. Tek tıkla incele ve kopyala.", "English": "Your AI-generated reply will appear here. Review and copy with one click.", "Deutsch": "Deine KI-Antwort erscheint hier. Mit einem Klick prüfen und kopieren.", "Français": "Votre réponse IA apparaîtra ici. Examinez et copiez en un clic.", "Italiano": "La tua risposta AI apparirà qui. Rivedi e copia in un click.", "Español (Spanish)": "Tu respuesta IA aparecerá aquí. Revísala y cópiala con un clic.", "Português": "A tua resposta IA aparecerá aqui. Revê e copia com um clique.", "Русский (Russian)": "ИИ-ответ появится здесь. Просмотрите и скопируйте.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "AI返信がここに表示されます。確認してワンクリックでコピー。", "中文 (Chinese)": "AI生成的回复将出现在这里。一键查看并复制。", "العربية (Arabic)": "سيظهر الرد المُنشأ هنا. راجعه وانسخه بنقرة واحدة.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आपका AI उत्तर यहाँ दिखेगा। देखें और एक क्लिक में कॉपी करें।"],
    "Your AI-generated reply will appear here...": ["Türkçe": "AI yanıtın burada görünecek...", "English": "Your AI-generated reply will appear here...", "Deutsch": "Deine KI-Antwort erscheint hier...", "Français": "Votre réponse IA apparaîtra ici...", "Italiano": "La tua risposta AI apparirà qui...", "Español (Spanish)": "Tu respuesta IA aparecerá aquí...", "Português": "A tua resposta IA aparecerá aqui...", "Русский (Russian)": "ИИ-ответ появится здесь...", "日本語 (Japanese)": "AI返信がここに表示されます...", "中文 (Chinese)": "AI生成的回复将出现在这里...", "العربية (Arabic)": "سيظهر الرد هنا...", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आपका AI उत्तर यहाँ दिखेगा..."],
    "Thank you for your message. We will get back to you shortly.": ["Türkçe": "Mesajın için teşekkürler. Kısa süre içinde dönüş yapacağız.", "English": "Thank you for your message. We will get back to you shortly.", "Deutsch": "Danke für deine Nachricht. Wir melden uns in Kürze.", "Français": "Merci pour votre message. Nous reviendrons vers vous rapidement.", "Italiano": "Grazie per il tuo messaggio. Ti risponderemo a breve.", "Español (Spanish)": "Gracias por tu mensaje. Te responderemos pronto.", "Português": "Obrigado pela mensagem. Voltaremos em breve.", "Русский (Russian)": "Спасибо за сообщение. Мы скоро свяжемся.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "メッセージありがとうございます。すぐにご返信いたします。", "中文 (Chinese)": "感谢您的消息，我们将很快回复您。", "العربية (Arabic)": "شكرًا على رسالتك، سنرد عليك قريبًا.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आपके संदेश के लिए धन्यवाद। हम जल्द ही जवाब देंगे।"],

    // ============================ STUDIO MESSAGES VIEW ============================
    "Workspace Messages": ["Türkçe": "Çalışma Alanı Mesajları", "English": "Workspace Messages", "Deutsch": "Workspace-Nachrichten", "Français": "Messages de l'espace", "Italiano": "Messaggi spazio", "Español (Spanish)": "Mensajes del espacio", "Português": "Mensagens do espaço", "Русский (Russian)": "Сообщения рабочего пространства", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ワークスペースメッセージ", "中文 (Chinese)": "工作区消息", "العربية (Arabic)": "رسائل مساحة العمل", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "वर्कस्पेस संदेश"],
    "Team Chat": ["Türkçe": "Ekip Sohbeti", "English": "Team Chat", "Deutsch": "Team-Chat", "Français": "Discussion équipe", "Italiano": "Chat di team", "Español (Spanish)": "Chat del equipo", "Português": "Chat de equipa", "Русский (Russian)": "Чат команды", "日本語 (Japanese)": "チームチャット", "中文 (Chinese)": "团队聊天", "العربية (Arabic)": "محادثة الفريق", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "टीम चैट"],
    "Direct Messages": ["Türkçe": "Direkt Mesajlar", "English": "Direct Messages", "Deutsch": "Direktnachrichten", "Français": "Messages directs", "Italiano": "Messaggi diretti", "Español (Spanish)": "Mensajes directos", "Português": "Mensagens diretas", "Русский (Russian)": "Личные сообщения", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ダイレクトメッセージ", "中文 (Chinese)": "私信", "العربية (Arabic)": "الرسائل المباشرة", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "डायरेक्ट मैसेज"],
    "Conversations": ["Türkçe": "Sohbetler", "English": "Conversations", "Deutsch": "Unterhaltungen", "Français": "Conversations", "Italiano": "Conversazioni", "Español (Spanish)": "Conversaciones", "Português": "Conversas", "Русский (Russian)": "Беседы", "日本語 (Japanese)": "会話", "中文 (Chinese)": "对话", "العربية (Arabic)": "المحادثات", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "बातचीत"],
    "Archived": ["Türkçe": "Arşivlenmiş", "English": "Archived", "Deutsch": "Archiviert", "Français": "Archivé", "Italiano": "Archiviato", "Español (Spanish)": "Archivado", "Português": "Arquivado", "Русский (Russian)": "В архиве", "日本語 (Japanese)": "アーカイブ済み", "中文 (Chinese)": "已归档", "العربية (Arabic)": "مؤرشف", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "संग्रहीत"],
    "Everyone in this workspace": ["Türkçe": "Bu çalışma alanındaki herkes", "English": "Everyone in this workspace", "Deutsch": "Alle in diesem Workspace", "Français": "Tout le monde dans cet espace", "Italiano": "Tutti in questo spazio", "Español (Spanish)": "Todos en este espacio", "Português": "Todos neste espaço", "Русский (Russian)": "Все в этом пространстве", "日本語 (Japanese)": "このワークスペースの全員", "中文 (Chinese)": "此工作区中的所有人", "العربية (Arabic)": "الجميع في مساحة العمل", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "इस वर्कस्पेस के सभी"],
    "Choose a team member": ["Türkçe": "Bir ekip üyesi seç", "English": "Choose a team member", "Deutsch": "Teammitglied auswählen", "Français": "Choisir un membre de l'équipe", "Italiano": "Scegli un membro del team", "Español (Spanish)": "Elige un miembro del equipo", "Português": "Escolhe um membro da equipa", "Русский (Russian)": "Выберите участника команды", "日本語 (Japanese)": "チームメンバーを選択", "中文 (Chinese)": "选择团队成员", "العربية (Arabic)": "اختر عضو الفريق", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "टीम सदस्य चुनें"],
    "Tap to start a private chat": ["Türkçe": "Özel sohbet başlatmak için dokun", "English": "Tap to start a private chat", "Deutsch": "Antippen für privaten Chat", "Français": "Appuyez pour démarrer un chat privé", "Italiano": "Tocca per iniziare una chat privata", "Español (Spanish)": "Toca para iniciar un chat privado", "Português": "Toca para iniciar um chat privado", "Русский (Russian)": "Нажмите, чтобы начать личный чат", "日本語 (Japanese)": "プライベートチャットを開始するにはタップ", "中文 (Chinese)": "点击开始私聊", "العربية (Arabic)": "اضغط لبدء محادثة خاصة", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "निजी चैट शुरू करने के लिए टैप करें"],
    "Direct messages are disabled for this workspace.": ["Türkçe": "Bu çalışma alanında direkt mesajlar kapalı.", "English": "Direct messages are disabled for this workspace.", "Deutsch": "Direktnachrichten sind in diesem Workspace deaktiviert.", "Français": "Les messages directs sont désactivés.", "Italiano": "I messaggi diretti sono disattivati.", "Español (Spanish)": "Los mensajes directos están desactivados.", "Português": "As mensagens diretas estão desativadas.", "Русский (Russian)": "Личные сообщения отключены.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "このワークスペースではDMは無効です。", "中文 (Chinese)": "此工作区已禁用私信。", "العربية (Arabic)": "الرسائل المباشرة معطلة في مساحة العمل.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "इस वर्कस्पेस के लिए डायरेक्ट संदेश बंद हैं।"],
    "Team members will appear here.": ["Türkçe": "Ekip üyeleri burada görünecek.", "English": "Team members will appear here.", "Deutsch": "Teammitglieder erscheinen hier.", "Français": "Les membres apparaîtront ici.", "Italiano": "I membri del team appariranno qui.", "Español (Spanish)": "Los miembros aparecerán aquí.", "Português": "Os membros aparecerão aqui.", "Русский (Russian)": "Здесь появятся участники.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "チームメンバーがここに表示されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "团队成员将显示在此处。", "العربية (Arabic)": "سيظهر أعضاء الفريق هنا.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "टीम सदस्य यहाँ दिखेंगे।"],
    "No direct conversations yet.": ["Türkçe": "Henüz direkt sohbet yok.", "English": "No direct conversations yet.", "Deutsch": "Noch keine Direktnachrichten.", "Français": "Pas encore de conversations.", "Italiano": "Nessuna conversazione diretta.", "Español (Spanish)": "Aún no hay conversaciones.", "Português": "Sem conversas diretas.", "Русский (Russian)": "Пока нет личных бесед.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "まだダイレクト会話はありません。", "中文 (Chinese)": "暂无私信对话。", "العربية (Arabic)": "لا توجد محادثات مباشرة بعد.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अभी तक कोई डायरेक्ट बातचीत नहीं।"],
    "No active conversations.": ["Türkçe": "Aktif sohbet yok.", "English": "No active conversations.", "Deutsch": "Keine aktiven Unterhaltungen.", "Français": "Aucune conversation active.", "Italiano": "Nessuna conversazione attiva.", "Español (Spanish)": "Sin conversaciones activas.", "Português": "Sem conversas ativas.", "Русский (Russian)": "Нет активных бесед.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "アクティブな会話はありません。", "中文 (Chinese)": "无活跃对话。", "العربية (Arabic)": "لا توجد محادثات نشطة.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "कोई सक्रिय बातचीत नहीं।"],
    "No conversations available": ["Türkçe": "Sohbet bulunamadı", "English": "No conversations available", "Deutsch": "Keine Unterhaltungen verfügbar", "Français": "Aucune conversation disponible", "Italiano": "Nessuna conversazione disponibile", "Español (Spanish)": "Sin conversaciones disponibles", "Português": "Sem conversas disponíveis", "Русский (Russian)": "Нет доступных бесед", "日本語 (Japanese)": "利用可能な会話なし", "中文 (Chinese)": "无可用对话", "العربية (Arabic)": "لا توجد محادثات متاحة", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "कोई बातचीत उपलब्ध नहीं"],
    "No messages yet": ["Türkçe": "Henüz mesaj yok", "English": "No messages yet", "Deutsch": "Noch keine Nachrichten", "Français": "Pas encore de messages", "Italiano": "Nessun messaggio", "Español (Spanish)": "Sin mensajes aún", "Português": "Ainda sem mensagens", "Русский (Russian)": "Пока нет сообщений", "日本語 (Japanese)": "まだメッセージはありません", "中文 (Chinese)": "暂无消息", "العربية (Arabic)": "لا توجد رسائل بعد", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अभी तक कोई संदेश नहीं"],
    "No more team members to add.": ["Türkçe": "Eklenecek başka üye yok.", "English": "No more team members to add.", "Deutsch": "Keine weiteren Mitglieder zum Hinzufügen.", "Français": "Plus de membres à ajouter.", "Italiano": "Nessun altro membro da aggiungere.", "Español (Spanish)": "No hay más miembros para añadir.", "Português": "Sem mais membros para adicionar.", "Русский (Russian)": "Нет других участников для добавления.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "追加するメンバーはこれ以上ありません。", "中文 (Chinese)": "没有更多团队成员可添加。", "العربية (Arabic)": "لا يوجد أعضاء آخرون لإضافتهم.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "जोड़ने के लिए और सदस्य नहीं।"],
    "No pinned messages yet.": ["Türkçe": "Henüz sabitlenmiş mesaj yok.", "English": "No pinned messages yet.", "Deutsch": "Noch keine angehefteten Nachrichten.", "Français": "Aucun message épinglé.", "Italiano": "Nessun messaggio fissato.", "Español (Spanish)": "Sin mensajes fijados.", "Português": "Sem mensagens fixadas.", "Русский (Russian)": "Нет закреплённых сообщений.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ピン留めされたメッセージなし。", "中文 (Chinese)": "暂无置顶消息。", "العربية (Arabic)": "لا توجد رسائل مثبتة.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अभी तक कोई पिन संदेश नहीं।"],
    "No saved messages yet. Use Save Message from any message menu.": ["Türkçe": "Henüz kaydedilmiş mesaj yok. Mesaj menüsünden Mesajı Kaydet'i kullan.", "English": "No saved messages yet. Use Save Message from any message menu.", "Deutsch": "Noch keine gespeicherten Nachrichten. Nutze 'Nachricht speichern'.", "Français": "Aucun message enregistré. Utilisez Enregistrer le message.", "Italiano": "Nessun messaggio salvato. Usa Salva messaggio.", "Español (Spanish)": "Sin mensajes guardados. Usa Guardar mensaje.", "Português": "Sem mensagens guardadas. Usa Guardar mensagem.", "Русский (Russian)": "Нет сохранённых сообщений. Используйте «Сохранить сообщение».", "日本語 (Japanese)": "保存されたメッセージなし。「メッセージを保存」を使用。", "中文 (Chinese)": "暂无保存的消息。使用消息菜单中的“保存消息”。", "العربية (Arabic)": "لا توجد رسائل محفوظة. استخدم حفظ الرسالة.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अभी तक कोई सेव संदेश नहीं।"],
    "No shared attachments yet.": ["Türkçe": "Henüz paylaşılan ek yok.", "English": "No shared attachments yet.", "Deutsch": "Noch keine geteilten Anhänge.", "Français": "Aucune pièce jointe partagée.", "Italiano": "Nessun allegato condiviso.", "Español (Spanish)": "Sin adjuntos compartidos.", "Português": "Sem anexos partilhados.", "Русский (Russian)": "Нет общих вложений.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "共有された添付ファイルはまだありません。", "中文 (Chinese)": "暂无共享附件。", "العربية (Arabic)": "لا توجد مرفقات مشتركة بعد.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अभी तक कोई शेयर अनुलग्नक नहीं।"],
    "Mute for 1 hour": ["Türkçe": "1 saatliğine sessize al", "English": "Mute for 1 hour", "Deutsch": "Für 1 Stunde stumm", "Français": "Mettre en sourdine 1 h", "Italiano": "Muta per 1 ora", "Español (Spanish)": "Silenciar 1 hora", "Português": "Silenciar 1 hora", "Русский (Russian)": "Без звука на 1 час", "日本語 (Japanese)": "1時間ミュート", "中文 (Chinese)": "静音1小时", "العربية (Arabic)": "كتم لساعة", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "1 घंटे म्यूट"],
    "Mute for today": ["Türkçe": "Bugünlük sessize al", "English": "Mute for today", "Deutsch": "Heute stumm", "Français": "En sourdine aujourd'hui", "Italiano": "Muta oggi", "Español (Spanish)": "Silenciar hoy", "Português": "Silenciar hoje", "Русский (Russian)": "На сегодня", "日本語 (Japanese)": "今日はミュート", "中文 (Chinese)": "今日静音", "العربية (Arabic)": "كتم اليوم", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आज म्यूट"],
    "Mute until I turn it back on": ["Türkçe": "Tekrar açana kadar sessiz", "English": "Mute until I turn it back on", "Deutsch": "Bis ich es wieder aktiviere", "Français": "Jusqu'à ce que je réactive", "Italiano": "Finché non riattivo", "Español (Spanish)": "Hasta que lo reactive", "Português": "Até reativar", "Русский (Russian)": "Пока не включу снова", "日本語 (Japanese)": "再度オンにするまで", "中文 (Chinese)": "直到我重新打开", "العربية (Arabic)": "حتى أعيد التشغيل", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "जब तक मैं वापस चालू न करूँ"],
    "Archive Conversation": ["Türkçe": "Sohbeti Arşivle", "English": "Archive Conversation", "Deutsch": "Unterhaltung archivieren", "Français": "Archiver la conversation", "Italiano": "Archivia conversazione", "Español (Spanish)": "Archivar conversación", "Português": "Arquivar conversa", "Русский (Russian)": "Архивировать беседу", "日本語 (Japanese)": "会話をアーカイブ", "中文 (Chinese)": "归档对话", "العربية (Arabic)": "أرشفة المحادثة", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "बातचीत संग्रहीत"],
