    "After changing your sign-in email, you can change it again after 10 days.": ["Türkçe": "Oturum açma e-postanızı değiştirdikten sonra 10 gün içinde tekrar değiştirebilirsiniz.", "English": "After changing your sign-in email, you can change it again after 10 days.", "Deutsch": "Nach Änderung kannst du es nach 10 Tagen wieder ändern.", "Français": "Après modification, vous pouvez la changer après 10 jours.", "Italiano": "Dopo la modifica, puoi cambiarla dopo 10 giorni.", "Español (Spanish)": "Tras cambiar el correo, puedes cambiarlo en 10 días.", "Português": "Após alterar, podes alterar de novo após 10 dias.", "Русский (Russian)": "После изменения можно сменить через 10 дней.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "サインインメール変更後、10日後に再変更可能。", "中文 (Chinese)": "更改后10天可再次更改。", "العربية (Arabic)": "بعد التغيير يمكنك التغيير مجددًا خلال 10 أيام.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "बदलने के बाद 10 दिनों में फिर बदल सकते हैं।"],
