    "Enter the owner’s email address or Company ID and send a request.": ["Türkçe": "Sahip e-posta adresini veya Şirket ID'sini girip istek gönder.", "English": "Enter the owner’s email address or Company ID and send a request.", "Deutsch": "Inhaber-E-Mail oder Firmen-ID eingeben und Anfrage senden.", "Français": "Saisir l'e-mail propriétaire ou l'ID, puis envoyer la demande.", "Italiano": "Inserisci email proprietario o ID azienda e invia richiesta.", "Español (Spanish)": "Introduce el correo o ID y envía la solicitud.", "Português": "Introduz o e-mail ou ID e envia o pedido.", "Русский (Russian)": "Введите email или ID и отправьте запрос.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "オーナーのメールまたは会社IDを入力してリクエスト送信。", "中文 (Chinese)": "输入所有者邮箱或公司ID并发送请求。", "العربية (Arabic)": "أدخل البريد أو معرف الشركة وأرسل الطلب.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "मालिक का ईमेल या कंपनी ID दर्ज करें।"],
