    "Delete role profile?": ["Türkçe": "Rol profili silinsin mi?", "English": "Delete role profile?", "Deutsch": "Rollenprofil löschen?", "Français": "Supprimer ce profil ?", "Italiano": "Eliminare profilo?", "Español (Spanish)": "¿Eliminar perfil?", "Português": "Eliminar perfil?", "Русский (Russian)": "Удалить профиль роли?", "日本語 (Japanese)": "役割プロフィールを削除？", "中文 (Chinese)": "删除角色配置？", "العربية (Arabic)": "حذف ملف الدور؟", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "रोल प्रोफ़ाइल हटाएँ?"],
    "A role with this name already exists.": ["Türkçe": "Bu isimde bir rol zaten var.", "English": "A role with this name already exists.", "Deutsch": "Eine Rolle mit diesem Namen existiert bereits.", "Français": "Un rôle avec ce nom existe déjà.", "Italiano": "Esiste già un ruolo con questo nome.", "Español (Spanish)": "Ya existe un rol con este nombre.", "Português": "Já existe uma função com este nome.", "Русский (Russian)": "Роль с таким именем уже существует.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "この名前の役割は既に存在します。", "中文 (Chinese)": "已存在同名角色。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يوجد دور بهذا الاسم بالفعل.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "इस नाम का रोल पहले से है।"],
    "Members must be moved away from this role before it can be deleted.": ["Türkçe": "Bu rol silinmeden önce üyeler başka role taşınmalı.", "English": "Members must be moved away from this role before it can be deleted.", "Deutsch": "Mitglieder müssen vor dem Löschen verschoben werden.", "Français": "Les membres doivent être déplacés avant suppression.", "Italiano": "I membri devono essere spostati prima dell'eliminazione.", "Español (Spanish)": "Mueva los miembros antes de eliminar.", "Português": "Move os membros antes de eliminar.", "Русский (Russian)": "Сначала переместите участников.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "削除前にメンバーを移動。", "中文 (Chinese)": "删除前请将成员移走。", "العربية (Arabic)": "انقل الأعضاء قبل الحذف.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "हटाने से पहले सदस्य हटाएँ।"],
    "Assign this role to members after creating it.": ["Türkçe": "Oluşturduktan sonra bu rolü üyelere atayın.", "English": "Assign this role to members after creating it.", "Deutsch": "Weise die Rolle nach dem Erstellen zu.", "Français": "Attribuez ce rôle après création.", "Italiano": "Assegna il ruolo dopo la creazione.", "Español (Spanish)": "Asigna el rol después de crearlo.", "Português": "Atribui o cargo após criar.", "Русский (Russian)": "Назначьте роль участникам после создания.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "作成後にメンバーへ割り当て。", "中文 (Chinese)": "创建后将此角色分配给成员。", "العربية (Arabic)": "عيّن الدور للأعضاء بعد إنشائه.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "बनाने के बाद रोल असाइन करें।"],
    "Base behavior": ["Türkçe": "Temel davranış", "English": "Base behavior", "Deutsch": "Standardverhalten", "Français": "Comportement de base", "Italiano": "Comportamento base", "Español (Spanish)": "Comportamiento base", "Português": "Comportamento base", "Русский (Russian)": "Базовое поведение", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ベース動作", "中文 (Chinese)": "基础行为", "العربية (Arabic)": "السلوك الأساسي", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "मूल व्यवहार"],
    "No custom role profiles yet.": ["Türkçe": "Henüz özel rol profili yok.", "English": "No custom role profiles yet.", "Deutsch": "Noch keine Rollenprofile.", "Français": "Aucun profil personnalisé.", "Italiano": "Nessun profilo personalizzato.", "Español (Spanish)": "Sin perfiles personalizados.", "Português": "Sem perfis personalizados.", "Русский (Russian)": "Нет своих профилей ролей.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "カスタム役割プロフィールなし。", "中文 (Chinese)": "暂无自定义角色配置。", "العربية (Arabic)": "لا توجد ملفات أدوار مخصصة بعد.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अभी तक कोई कस्टम रोल प्रोफ़ाइल नहीं।"],
