    "Connect real App Store products to NivaDesk plans.": ["Türkçe": "Gerçek App Store ürünlerini NivaDesk planlarına bağla.", "English": "Connect real App Store products to NivaDesk plans.", "Deutsch": "Verbinde echte App Store-Produkte mit NivaDesk-Plänen.", "Français": "Connectez des produits App Store aux plans.", "Italiano": "Collega prodotti App Store ai piani.", "Español (Spanish)": "Conecta productos de App Store con los planes.", "Português": "Conecta produtos da App Store aos planos.", "Русский (Russian)": "Свяжите продукты App Store с тарифами.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "App Store製品をNivaDeskプランに接続。", "中文 (Chinese)": "将真实 App Store 产品连接到 NivaDesk 套餐。", "العربية (Arabic)": "اربط منتجات App Store بخطط NivaDesk.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "App Store उत्पादों को NivaDesk योजनाओं से जोड़ें।"],
    "Create this product ID in App Store Connect.": ["Türkçe": "Bu ürün kimliğini App Store Connect'te oluştur.", "English": "Create this product ID in App Store Connect.", "Deutsch": "Erstelle diese Produkt-ID in App Store Connect.", "Français": "Créez cet ID produit dans App Store Connect.", "Italiano": "Crea questo ID prodotto in App Store Connect.", "Español (Spanish)": "Crea este ID de producto en App Store Connect.", "Português": "Cria este ID de produto no App Store Connect.", "Русский (Russian)": "Создайте этот ID в App Store Connect.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "App Store ConnectでこのプロダクトIDを作成。", "中文 (Chinese)": "在 App Store Connect 中创建此产品ID。", "العربية (Arabic)": "أنشئ معرف المنتج في App Store Connect.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "App Store Connect में यह उत्पाद ID बनाएँ।"],
    "Subscribe": ["Türkçe": "Abone Ol", "English": "Subscribe", "Deutsch": "Abonnieren", "Français": "S'abonner", "Italiano": "Abbonati", "Español (Spanish)": "Suscribirse", "Português": "Subscrever", "Русский (Russian)": "Подписаться", "日本語 (Japanese)": "登録", "中文 (Chinese)": "订阅", "العربية (Arabic)": "اشترك", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सदस्यता लें"],
    "Choose monthly or yearly in App Store Purchases below.": ["Türkçe": "Aşağıdaki App Store Satın Alımları bölümünden aylık veya yıllık seçeneği seçin.", "English": "Choose monthly or yearly in App Store Purchases below.", "Deutsch": "Wähle unten monatlich oder jährlich bei App Store-Käufen.", "Français": "Choisissez mensuel ou annuel dans les achats App Store ci-dessous.", "Italiano": "Scegli mensile o annuale negli acquisti App Store qui sotto.", "Español (Spanish)": "Elige mensual o anual en las compras de App Store de abajo.", "Português": "Escolhe mensal ou anual nas compras da App Store abaixo.", "Русский (Russian)": "Выберите месячную или годовую подписку ниже.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "下のApp Store購入で月額または年額を選択してください。", "中文 (Chinese)": "请在下方 App Store 购买中选择月付或年付。", "العربية (Arabic)": "اختر الاشتراك الشهري أو السنوي أدناه.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "नीचे App Store खरीद में मासिक या वार्षिक चुनें।"],
    "Purchase confirmed. Verifying subscription access.": ["Türkçe": "Satın alma onaylandı. Abonelik erişimi doğrulanıyor.", "English": "Purchase confirmed. Verifying subscription access.", "Deutsch": "Kauf bestätigt. Abonnementzugriff wird geprüft.", "Français": "Achat confirmé. Vérification de l'accès.", "Italiano": "Acquisto confermato. Verifica accesso in corso.", "Español (Spanish)": "Compra confirmada. Verificando acceso.", "Português": "Compra confirmada. A verificar acesso.", "Русский (Russian)": "Покупка подтверждена. Проверяем доступ.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "購入を確認しました。アクセスを確認中です。", "中文 (Chinese)": "购买已确认，正在验证访问权限。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم تأكيد الشراء. جارٍ التحقق من الوصول.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "खरीद की पुष्टि हुई। पहुँच सत्यापित की जा रही है।"],
    "Purchase verified. Your workspace plan is active.": ["Türkçe": "Satın alma doğrulandı. Çalışma alanı planınız aktif.", "English": "Purchase verified. Your workspace plan is active.", "Deutsch": "Kauf verifiziert. Ihr Workspace-Plan ist aktiv.", "Français": "Achat vérifié. Votre plan est actif.", "Italiano": "Acquisto verificato. Il piano è attivo.", "Español (Spanish)": "Compra verificada. Tu plan está activo.", "Português": "Compra verificada. O plano está ativo.", "Русский (Russian)": "Покупка подтверждена. Тариф активен.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "購入が確認され、プランが有効になりました。", "中文 (Chinese)": "购买已验证，工作区套餐已启用。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم التحقق من الشراء. خطتك نشطة.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "खरीद सत्यापित हुई। आपकी योजना सक्रिय है।"],
    "Purchase restored. Your workspace plan is active.": ["Türkçe": "Satın alma geri yüklendi. Çalışma alanı planınız aktif.", "English": "Purchase restored. Your workspace plan is active.", "Deutsch": "Kauf wiederhergestellt. Ihr Workspace-Plan ist aktiv.", "Français": "Achat restauré. Votre plan est actif.", "Italiano": "Acquisto ripristinato. Il piano è attivo.", "Español (Spanish)": "Compra restaurada. Tu plan está activo.", "Português": "Compra restaurada. O plano está ativo.", "Русский (Russian)": "Покупка восстановлена. Тариф активен.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "購入が復元され、プランが有効になりました。", "中文 (Chinese)": "购买已恢复，工作区套餐已启用。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تمت استعادة الشراء. خطتك نشطة.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "खरीद बहाल हुई। आपकी योजना सक्रिय है।"],
    "Apple Calendar and Reminders are available from NivaDesk Lite.": ["Türkçe": "Apple Calendar ve Reminders NivaDesk Lite'tan itibaren kullanılabilir.", "English": "Apple Calendar and Reminders are available from NivaDesk Lite.", "Deutsch": "Apple Kalender und Erinnerungen ab NivaDesk Lite.", "Français": "Apple Calendrier et Rappels dès NivaDesk Lite.", "Italiano": "Apple Calendar e Promemoria da NivaDesk Lite.", "Español (Spanish)": "Apple Calendario y Recordatorios desde NivaDesk Lite.", "Português": "Apple Calendário e Lembretes a partir do NivaDesk Lite.", "Русский (Russian)": "Apple Calendar и Напоминания доступны в NivaDesk Lite.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Apple カレンダーとリマインダーはNivaDesk Liteから利用可能。", "中文 (Chinese)": "Apple 日历和提醒事项自 NivaDesk Lite 起可用。", "العربية (Arabic)": "Apple Calendar وRemindersمتاح من NivaDesk Lite.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Apple Calendar और Reminders NivaDesk Lite से उपलब्ध।"],
