    "Bank connections are managed by the workspace owner.": ["English": "Bank connections are managed by the workspace owner.", "Türkçe": "Banka bağlantılarını çalışma alanı sahibi yönetir.", "Deutsch": "Bankverbindungen verwaltet der Workspace-Inhaber.", "Français": "Les connexions bancaires sont gérées par le propriétaire de l'espace.", "Italiano": "Le connessioni bancarie sono gestite dal proprietario dello spazio.", "Español (Spanish)": "Las conexiones bancarias las gestiona el propietario del espacio.", "Português": "As ligações bancárias são geridas pelo proprietário do espaço.", "Русский (Russian)": "Подключениями банка управляет владелец рабочего пространства.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "銀行接続はワークスペースのオーナーが管理します。", "中文 (Chinese)": "银行连接由工作区所有者管理。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يدير مالك مساحة العمل اتصالات البنك.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "बैंक कनेक्शन वर्कस्पेस स्वामी प्रबंधित करता है।"],
    "Bank connections are available from NivaDesk Pro.": ["English": "Bank connections are available from NivaDesk Pro.", "Türkçe": "Banka bağlantıları NivaDesk Pro ve üzerinde kullanılabilir.", "Deutsch": "Bankverbindungen sind ab NivaDesk Pro verfügbar.", "Français": "Les connexions bancaires sont disponibles à partir de NivaDesk Pro.", "Italiano": "Le connessioni bancarie sono disponibili da NivaDesk Pro.", "Español (Spanish)": "Las conexiones bancarias están disponibles desde NivaDesk Pro.", "Português": "As ligações bancárias estão disponíveis a partir do NivaDesk Pro.", "Русский (Russian)": "Подключение банка доступно начиная с NivaDesk Pro.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "銀行連携は NivaDesk Pro 以上でご利用いただけます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "银行连接自 NivaDesk Pro 起可用。", "العربية (Arabic)": "اتصالات البنك متاحة بدءًا من NivaDesk Pro.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "बैंक कनेक्शन NivaDesk Pro से उपलब्ध हैं।"],
