    "In progress": ["Türkçe": "Sürüyor", "English": "In progress", "Deutsch": "Läuft", "Français": "En cours", "Italiano": "In corso", "Español (Spanish)": "En curso", "Português": "Em curso", "Русский (Russian)": "В процессе", "日本語 (Japanese)": "進行中", "中文 (Chinese)": "进行中", "العربية (Arabic)": "قيد التنفيذ", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "चल रहा है"],
