    "What it is worth, by category": ["Türkçe": "Kategoriye göre değeri", "English": "What it is worth, by category", "Deutsch": "Wert nach Kategorie", "Français": "Valeur par catégorie", "Italiano": "Valore per categoria", "Español (Spanish)": "Valor por categoría", "Português": "Valor por categoria", "Русский (Russian)": "Стоимость по категориям", "日本語 (Japanese)": "カテゴリ別の価値", "中文 (Chinese)": "按类别的价值", "العربية (Arabic)": "القيمة حسب الفئة", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "श्रेणी के अनुसार मूल्य"],
    "What moved": ["Türkçe": "Ne hareket etti", "English": "What moved", "Deutsch": "Was sich bewegt hat", "Français": "Ce qui a bougé", "Italiano": "Cosa si è mosso", "Español (Spanish)": "Qué se movió", "Português": "O que se moveu", "Русский (Russian)": "Что двигалось", "日本語 (Japanese)": "何が動いたか", "中文 (Chinese)": "有什么变动", "العربية (Arabic)": "ما الذي تحرّك", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "क्या हिला-डुला"],
    "What the stock is worth today, and what has moved.": ["Türkçe": "Stok bugün ne ediyor ve ne hareket etti.", "English": "What the stock is worth today, and what has moved.", "Deutsch": "Was der Bestand heute wert ist und was sich bewegt hat.", "Français": "Ce que vaut le stock aujourd'hui, et ce qui a bougé.", "Italiano": "Quanto vale la giacenza oggi e cosa si è mosso.", "Español (Spanish)": "Cuánto vale el stock hoy y qué se ha movido.", "Português": "Quanto vale o stock hoje e o que se moveu.", "Русский (Russian)": "Сколько запас стоит сегодня и что двигалось.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "在庫の今の価値と、何が動いたか。", "中文 (Chinese)": "库存今天值多少，以及有什么变动。", "العربية (Arabic)": "كم تساوي البضاعة اليوم، وما الذي تحرّك.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "स्टॉक आज कितने का है, और क्या हिला-डुला।"],
    "but orders are holding": ["Türkçe": "ama siparişler şu kadarını tutuyor", "English": "but orders are holding", "Deutsch": "aber Aufträge halten", "Français": "mais des commandes en réservent", "Italiano": "ma gli ordini ne trattengono", "Español (Spanish)": "pero los pedidos retienen", "Português": "mas as encomendas estão a reter", "Русский (Russian)": "но заказы удерживают", "日本語 (Japanese)": "しかし注文が確保しているのは", "中文 (Chinese)": "但订单占用了", "العربية (Arabic)": "لكن الطلبات تحجز", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "पर ऑर्डर रोके हुए हैं"],
    "days": ["Türkçe": "gün", "English": "days", "Deutsch": "Tage", "Français": "jours", "Italiano": "giorni", "Español (Spanish)": "días", "Português": "dias", "Русский (Russian)": "дней", "日本語 (Japanese)": "日", "中文 (Chinese)": "天", "العربية (Arabic)": "يوم", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "दिन"],
    "days or more.": ["Türkçe": "gün veya daha fazla.", "English": "days or more.", "Deutsch": "Tagen oder länger nichts passiert.", "Français": "jours ou plus.", "Italiano": "giorni o più.", "Español (Spanish)": "días o más.", "Português": "dias ou mais.", "Русский (Russian)": "дней или дольше.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "日以上。", "中文 (Chinese)": "天或更久没有任何变动。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يوماً أو أكثر.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "दिनों या उससे अधिक।"],
