    "Enter how much to reserve.": ["Türkçe": "Ne kadar ayrılacağını girin.", "English": "Enter how much to reserve.", "Deutsch": "Geben Sie an, wie viel reserviert werden soll.", "Français": "Indiquez la quantité à réserver.", "Italiano": "Indica quanto riservare.", "Español (Spanish)": "Indica cuánto reservar.", "Português": "Indique quanto reservar.", "Русский (Russian)": "Укажите, сколько зарезервировать.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "確保する数量を入力してください。", "中文 (Chinese)": "请输入要预留的数量。", "العربية (Arabic)": "أدخل الكمية المراد حجزها.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "बताएँ कि कितना आरक्षित करना है।"],
    "Inventory could not be loaded.": ["Türkçe": "Envanter yüklenemedi.", "English": "Inventory could not be loaded.", "Deutsch": "Bestand konnte nicht geladen werden.", "Français": "L'inventaire n'a pas pu être chargé.", "Italiano": "Impossibile caricare l'inventario.", "Español (Spanish)": "No se pudo cargar el inventario.", "Português": "Não foi possível carregar o inventário.", "Русский (Russian)": "Не удалось загрузить инвентарь.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "在庫を読み込めませんでした。", "中文 (Chinese)": "无法加载库存。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تعذّر تحميل المخزون.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "इन्वेंटरी लोड नहीं हो सकी।"],
