    "Invoice / order reference": ["Türkçe": "Fatura / sipariş referansı", "English": "Invoice / order reference", "Deutsch": "Rechnungs-/Bestellreferenz", "Français": "Référence facture / commande", "Italiano": "Riferimento fattura / ordine", "Español (Spanish)": "Referencia de factura / pedido", "Português": "Referência de fatura / encomenda", "Русский (Russian)": "Ссылка на счёт / заказ", "日本語 (Japanese)": "請求書・注文の参照番号", "中文 (Chinese)": "发票／订单参考号", "العربية (Arabic)": "مرجع الفاتورة / الطلب", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "इनवॉइस / ऑर्डर संदर्भ"],
