    "Purchases": ["Türkçe": "Alımlar", "English": "Purchases", "Deutsch": "Einkäufe", "Français": "Achats", "Italiano": "Acquisti", "Español (Spanish)": "Compras", "Português": "Compras", "Русский (Russian)": "Закупки", "日本語 (Japanese)": "仕入", "中文 (Chinese)": "采购", "العربية (Arabic)": "المشتريات", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "खरीद"],
