    "Confidence": ["English": "Confidence", "Türkçe": "Güven", "Deutsch": "Sicherheit", "Français": "Fiabilité", "Italiano": "Affidabilità", "Español (Spanish)": "Confianza", "Português": "Confiança", "Русский (Russian)": "Уверенность", "日本語 (Japanese)": "信頼度", "中文 (Chinese)": "置信度", "العربية (Arabic)": "درجة الثقة", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "विश्वसनीयता"],
