    "Use on the job": ["English": "Use on the job", "Türkçe": "İşte kullan", "Deutsch": "Im Auftrag verwenden", "Français": "Utiliser pour ce travail", "Italiano": "Usa per il lavoro", "Español (Spanish)": "Usar en el trabajo", "Português": "Usar no trabalho", "Русский (Russian)": "Использовать в работе", "日本語 (Japanese)": "この作業で使用", "中文 (Chinese)": "用于此工单", "العربية (Arabic)": "استخدام في العمل", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "जॉब में उपयोग करें"],
