    "Waiting for DNS": ["English": "Waiting for DNS", "Türkçe": "DNS bekleniyor", "Deutsch": "Warten auf DNS", "Français": "En attente du DNS", "Italiano": "In attesa del DNS", "Español (Spanish)": "Esperando el DNS", "Português": "A aguardar o DNS", "Русский (Russian)": "Ожидание DNS", "日本語 (Japanese)": "DNS待ち", "中文 (Chinese)": "等待 DNS", "العربية (Arabic)": "في انتظار DNS", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "DNS की प्रतीक्षा में"],
    "Add this DNS record at your domain provider:": ["English": "Add this DNS record at your domain provider:", "Türkçe": "Bu DNS kaydını alan adı sağlayıcınızda ekleyin:", "Deutsch": "Fügen Sie diesen DNS-Eintrag bei Ihrem Domain-Anbieter hinzu:", "Français": "Ajoutez cet enregistrement DNS chez votre fournisseur de domaine :", "Italiano": "Aggiungi questo record DNS presso il tuo provider di dominio:", "Español (Spanish)": "Añade este registro DNS en tu proveedor de dominio:", "Português": "Adicione este registo DNS no seu fornecedor de domínio:", "Русский (Russian)": "Добавьте эту DNS-запись у регистратора домена:", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ドメインプロバイダーでこのDNSレコードを追加してください：", "中文 (Chinese)": "在你的域名服务商处添加此 DNS 记录：", "العربية (Arabic)": "أضف سجل DNS هذا لدى مزوّد النطاق الخاص بك:", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अपने डोमेन प्रदाता के यहाँ यह DNS रिकॉर्ड जोड़ें:"],
    "Found": ["English": "Found", "Türkçe": "Bulunan", "Deutsch": "Gefunden", "Français": "Trouvé", "Italiano": "Trovato", "Español (Spanish)": "Encontrado", "Português": "Encontrado", "Русский (Russian)": "Найдено", "日本語 (Japanese)": "検出", "中文 (Chinese)": "找到", "العربية (Arabic)": "الموجود", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "मिला"],
    "expected": ["English": "expected", "Türkçe": "beklenen", "Deutsch": "erwartet", "Français": "attendu", "Italiano": "atteso", "Español (Spanish)": "esperado", "Português": "esperado", "Русский (Russian)": "ожидалось", "日本語 (Japanese)": "期待値", "中文 (Chinese)": "预期为", "العربية (Arabic)": "المتوقع", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अपेक्षित"],
    "DNS changes can take up to an hour to spread.": ["English": "DNS changes can take up to an hour to spread.", "Türkçe": "DNS değişikliklerinin yayılması bir saati bulabilir.", "Deutsch": "DNS-Änderungen können bis zu einer Stunde brauchen, um sich zu verbreiten.", "Français": "Les modifications DNS peuvent mettre jusqu'à une heure à se propager.", "Italiano": "Le modifiche DNS possono impiegare fino a un'ora per propagarsi.", "Español (Spanish)": "Los cambios de DNS pueden tardar hasta una hora en propagarse.", "Português": "As alterações de DNS podem demorar até uma hora a propagar-se.", "Русский (Russian)": "Изменения DNS могут распространяться до часа.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "DNSの変更が反映されるまで最大1時間かかることがあります。", "中文 (Chinese)": "DNS 更改可能需要最多一小时才能生效。", "العربية (Arabic)": "قد تستغرق تغييرات DNS حتى ساعة لتنتشر.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "DNS परिवर्तनों को फैलने में एक घंटे तक लग सकता है।"],
    "No CNAME record found yet.": ["English": "No CNAME record found yet.", "Türkçe": "Henüz CNAME kaydı bulunamadı.", "Deutsch": "Noch kein CNAME-Eintrag gefunden.", "Français": "Aucun enregistrement CNAME trouvé pour l'instant.", "Italiano": "Nessun record CNAME trovato per ora.", "Español (Spanish)": "Aún no se ha encontrado ningún registro CNAME.", "Português": "Ainda não foi encontrado nenhum registo CNAME.", "Русский (Russian)": "Запись CNAME пока не найдена.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "CNAMEレコードはまだ見つかりません。", "中文 (Chinese)": "尚未找到 CNAME 记录。", "العربية (Arabic)": "لم يتم العثور على سجل CNAME بعد.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अभी तक कोई CNAME रिकॉर्ड नहीं मिला।"],
    "A verified domain is reserved for your workspace; serving your links on it is being rolled out and older nivadesk.app links keep working.": ["English": "A verified domain is reserved for your workspace; serving your links on it is being rolled out and older nivadesk.app links keep working.", "Türkçe": "Doğrulanmış bir alan adı çalışma alanınız için ayrılır; bağlantılarınızın bu alan adından sunulması aşamalı olarak devreye alınıyor ve eski nivadesk.app bağlantıları çalışmaya devam ediyor.", "Deutsch": "Eine verifizierte Domain ist für Ihren Arbeitsbereich reserviert; die Auslieferung Ihrer Links darüber wird schrittweise eingeführt und ältere nivadesk.app-Links funktionieren weiterhin.", "Français": "Un domaine vérifié est réservé à votre espace de travail ; la diffusion de vos liens dessus est en cours de déploiement et les anciens liens nivadesk.app continuent de fonctionner.", "Italiano": "Un dominio verificato è riservato al tuo workspace; la pubblicazione dei tuoi link su di esso è in fase di rollout e i vecchi link nivadesk.app continuano a funzionare.", "Español (Spanish)": "Un dominio verificado queda reservado para tu espacio de trabajo; servir tus enlaces en él se está desplegando y los enlaces antiguos de nivadesk.app siguen funcionando.", "Português": "Um domínio verificado fica reservado para o seu espaço de trabalho; servir as suas ligações nele está a ser implementado e as ligações antigas nivadesk.app continuam a funcionar.", "Русский (Russian)": "Подтверждённый домен закрепляется за вашим рабочим пространством; выдача ссылок на нём постепенно внедряется, а старые ссылки nivadesk.app продолжают работать.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "確認済みドメインはワークスペース用に予約されます。そのドメインでのリンク配信は順次展開中で、従来のnivadesk.appリンクは引き続き使えます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "已验证的域名将为你的工作区保留；在该域名上提供链接的功能正在逐步推出，旧的 nivadesk.app 链接仍然有效。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يُحجز النطاق المتحقق منه لمساحة عملك؛ ويجري طرح تقديم روابطك عليه تدريجيًا، وتظل روابط nivadesk.app القديمة تعمل.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सत्यापित डोमेन आपके वर्कस्पेस के लिए आरक्षित रहता है; उस पर आपके लिंक दिखाना धीरे-धीरे शुरू हो रहा है और पुराने nivadesk.app लिंक काम करते रहेंगे।"],
    "The domain settings could not be loaded.": ["English": "The domain settings could not be loaded.", "Türkçe": "Alan adı ayarları yüklenemedi.", "Deutsch": "Die Domain-Einstellungen konnten nicht geladen werden.", "Français": "Impossible de charger les paramètres de domaine.", "Italiano": "Impossibile caricare le impostazioni del dominio.", "Español (Spanish)": "No se pudieron cargar los ajustes del dominio.", "Português": "Não foi possível carregar as definições do domínio.", "Русский (Russian)": "Не удалось загрузить настройки домена.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ドメイン設定を読み込めませんでした。", "中文 (Chinese)": "无法加载域名设置。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تعذر تحميل إعدادات النطاق.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "डोमेन सेटिंग्स लोड नहीं हो सकीं।"],
    "Something went wrong.": ["English": "Something went wrong.", "Türkçe": "Bir şeyler ters gitti.", "Deutsch": "Etwas ist schiefgelaufen.", "Français": "Une erreur s'est produite.", "Italiano": "Qualcosa è andato storto.", "Español (Spanish)": "Algo salió mal.", "Português": "Algo correu mal.", "Русский (Russian)": "Что-то пошло не так.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "問題が発生しました。", "中文 (Chinese)": "出了点问题。", "العربية (Arabic)": "حدث خطأ ما.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "कुछ गड़बड़ हो गई।"],
    "Subdomain saved.": ["English": "Subdomain saved.", "Türkçe": "Alt alan adı kaydedildi.", "Deutsch": "Subdomain gespeichert.", "Français": "Sous-domaine enregistré.", "Italiano": "Sottodominio salvato.", "Español (Spanish)": "Subdominio guardado.", "Português": "Subdomínio guardado.", "Русский (Russian)": "Поддомен сохранён.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "サブドメインを保存しました。", "中文 (Chinese)": "子域名已保存。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم حفظ النطاق الفرعي.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सबडोमेन सहेजा गया।"],
    "Domain added — now create the DNS record below and verify.": ["English": "Domain added — now create the DNS record below and verify.", "Türkçe": "Alan adı eklendi — şimdi aşağıdaki DNS kaydını oluşturun ve doğrulayın.", "Deutsch": "Domain hinzugefügt — erstellen Sie jetzt den DNS-Eintrag unten und verifizieren Sie.", "Français": "Domaine ajouté — créez maintenant l'enregistrement DNS ci-dessous et vérifiez.", "Italiano": "Dominio aggiunto — ora crea il record DNS qui sotto e verifica.", "Español (Spanish)": "Dominio añadido: ahora crea el registro DNS de abajo y verifícalo.", "Português": "Domínio adicionado — agora crie o registo DNS abaixo e verifique.", "Русский (Russian)": "Домен добавлен — теперь создайте DNS-запись ниже и проверьте.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ドメインを追加しました — 下のDNSレコードを作成して確認してください。", "中文 (Chinese)": "域名已添加——现在创建下面的 DNS 记录并验证。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تمت إضافة النطاق — أنشئ الآن سجل DNS أدناه ثم تحقق.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "डोमेन जोड़ा गया — अब नीचे दिया गया DNS रिकॉर्ड बनाएं और सत्यापित करें।"],
    "Domain removed.": ["English": "Domain removed.", "Türkçe": "Alan adı kaldırıldı.", "Deutsch": "Domain entfernt.", "Français": "Domaine supprimé.", "Italiano": "Dominio rimosso.", "Español (Spanish)": "Dominio eliminado.", "Português": "Domínio removido.", "Русский (Russian)": "Домен удалён.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ドメインを削除しました。", "中文 (Chinese)": "域名已移除。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تمت إزالة النطاق.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "डोमेन हटाया गया।"],
    "Checked.": ["English": "Checked.", "Türkçe": "Kontrol edildi.", "Deutsch": "Geprüft.", "Français": "Vérifié.", "Italiano": "Controllato.", "Español (Spanish)": "Comprobado.", "Português": "Verificado.", "Русский (Russian)": "Проверено.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "確認しました。", "中文 (Chinese)": "已检查。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم الفحص.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "जाँच हो गई।"],
    "The client domain is managed by the workspace owner.": ["English": "The client domain is managed by the workspace owner.", "Türkçe": "Müşteri alan adını çalışma alanı sahibi yönetir.", "Deutsch": "Die Kunden-Domain wird vom Arbeitsbereich-Inhaber verwaltet.", "Français": "Le domaine client est géré par le propriétaire de l'espace de travail.", "Italiano": "Il dominio clienti è gestito dal proprietario del workspace.", "Español (Spanish)": "El dominio de clientes lo gestiona el propietario del espacio de trabajo.", "Português": "O domínio de clientes é gerido pelo proprietário do espaço de trabalho.", "Русский (Russian)": "Клиентским доменом управляет владелец рабочего пространства.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "顧客ドメインはワークスペースのオーナーが管理します。", "中文 (Chinese)": "客户域名由工作区所有者管理。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يدير مالك مساحة العمل نطاق العملاء.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "क्लाइंट डोमेन का प्रबंधन वर्कस्पेस स्वामी करता है।"],
    "Customer page branding": ["English": "Customer page branding", "Türkçe": "Müşteri sayfası markalama", "Deutsch": "Branding der Kundenseite", "Français": "Personnalisation de la page client", "Italiano": "Personalizzazione della pagina cliente", "Español (Spanish)": "Marca de la página del cliente", "Português": "Identidade visual da página do cliente", "Русский (Russian)": "Оформление страницы для клиентов", "日本語 (Japanese)": "顧客ページのブランディング", "中文 (Chinese)": "客户页面品牌设置", "العربية (Arabic)": "تخصيص صفحة العميل", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "ग्राहक पेज ब्रांडिंग"],
    "Accent colour": ["English": "Accent colour", "Türkçe": "Vurgu rengi", "Deutsch": "Akzentfarbe", "Français": "Couleur d’accent", "Italiano": "Colore in evidenza", "Español (Spanish)": "Color de acento", "Português": "Cor de destaque", "Русский (Russian)": "Акцентный цвет", "日本語 (Japanese)": "アクセントカラー", "中文 (Chinese)": "主题色", "العربية (Arabic)": "لون التمييز", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "एक्सेंट रंग"],
    "Use the default colour": ["English": "Use the default colour", "Türkçe": "Varsayılan rengi kullan", "Deutsch": "Standardfarbe verwenden", "Français": "Utiliser la couleur par défaut", "Italiano": "Usa il colore predefinito", "Español (Spanish)": "Usar el color predeterminado", "Português": "Usar a cor padrão", "Русский (Russian)": "Использовать цвет по умолчанию", "日本語 (Japanese)": "デフォルトの色を使用", "中文 (Chinese)": "使用默认颜色", "العربية (Arabic)": "استخدام اللون الافتراضي", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "डिफ़ॉल्ट रंग का उपयोग करें"],
    "Show “Powered by NivaDesk” on customer pages": ["English": "Show “Powered by NivaDesk” on customer pages", "Türkçe": "Müşteri sayfalarında “Powered by NivaDesk” yazısını göster", "Deutsch": "„Powered by NivaDesk“ auf Kundenseiten anzeigen", "Français": "Afficher « Powered by NivaDesk » sur les pages client", "Italiano": "Mostra “Powered by NivaDesk” sulle pagine cliente", "Español (Spanish)": "Mostrar “Powered by NivaDesk” en las páginas del cliente", "Português": "Mostrar “Powered by NivaDesk” nas páginas do cliente", "Русский (Russian)": "Показывать надпись «Powered by NivaDesk» на страницах для клиентов", "日本語 (Japanese)": "顧客ページに「Powered by NivaDesk」を表示", "中文 (Chinese)": "在客户页面上显示“Powered by NivaDesk”", "العربية (Arabic)": "إظهار «Powered by NivaDesk» في صفحات العملاء", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "ग्राहक पेजों पर “Powered by NivaDesk” दिखाएँ"],
    "Branding saved.": ["English": "Branding saved.", "Türkçe": "Markalama kaydedildi.", "Deutsch": "Branding gespeichert.", "Français": "Personnalisation enregistrée.", "Italiano": "Personalizzazione salvata.", "Español (Spanish)": "Marca guardada.", "Português": "Identidade visual salva.", "Русский (Russian)": "Оформление сохранено.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ブランディングを保存しました。", "中文 (Chinese)": "品牌设置已保存。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم حفظ التخصيص.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "ब्रांडिंग सहेजी गई।"],
    "The accent colours the order tracking page. Hiding the Powered by line is part of the Pro and Team plans.": ["English": "The accent colours the order tracking page. Hiding the Powered by line is part of the Pro and Team plans.", "Türkçe": "Vurgu rengi sipariş takip sayfasını renklendirir. Powered by satırını gizleme özelliği Pro ve Team planlarına dahildir.", "Deutsch": "Die Akzentfarbe gestaltet die Auftragsverfolgungsseite. Das Ausblenden der Powered-by-Zeile ist Teil der Pro- und Team-Pläne.", "Français": "La couleur d’accent colore la page de suivi de commande. Le masquage de la mention Powered by est inclus dans les forfaits Pro et Team.", "Italiano": "Il colore in evidenza colora la pagina di tracciamento degli ordini. Nascondere la riga Powered by fa parte dei piani Pro e Team.", "Español (Spanish)": "El color de acento da color a la página de seguimiento de pedidos. Ocultar la línea Powered by forma parte de los planes Pro y Team.", "Português": "A cor de destaque colore a página de acompanhamento de pedidos. Ocultar a linha Powered by faz parte dos planos Pro e Team.", "Русский (Russian)": "Акцентный цвет применяется к странице отслеживания заказа. Скрытие надписи «Powered by» доступно в планах Pro и Team.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "アクセントカラーは注文追跡ページに適用されます。Powered by の表記を非表示にできるのは Pro および Team プランの機能です。", "中文 (Chinese)": "主题色用于订单跟踪页面。隐藏 Powered by 字样是 Pro 和 Team 套餐的功能。", "العربية (Arabic)": "لون التمييز يلوّن صفحة تتبع الطلب. إخفاء سطر Powered by متاح ضمن خطتي Pro وTeam.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "एक्सेंट रंग ऑर्डर ट्रैकिंग पेज को रंग देता है। Powered by पंक्ति को छिपाना Pro और Team प्लान का हिस्सा है।"],
    "Hiding the Powered by NivaDesk line is part of the Pro and Team plans.": ["English": "Hiding the Powered by NivaDesk line is part of the Pro and Team plans.", "Türkçe": "Powered by NivaDesk satırını gizleme özelliği Pro ve Team planlarına dahildir.", "Deutsch": "Das Ausblenden der Zeile „Powered by NivaDesk“ ist Teil der Pro- und Team-Pläne.", "Français": "Le masquage de la mention Powered by NivaDesk est inclus dans les forfaits Pro et Team.", "Italiano": "Nascondere la riga Powered by NivaDesk fa parte dei piani Pro e Team.", "Español (Spanish)": "Ocultar la línea Powered by NivaDesk forma parte de los planes Pro y Team.", "Português": "Ocultar a linha Powered by NivaDesk faz parte dos planos Pro e Team.", "Русский (Russian)": "Скрытие надписи «Powered by NivaDesk» доступно в планах Pro и Team.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Powered by NivaDesk の表記を非表示にできるのは Pro および Team プランの機能です。", "中文 (Chinese)": "隐藏 Powered by NivaDesk 字样是 Pro 和 Team 套餐的功能。", "العربية (Arabic)": "إخفاء سطر Powered by NivaDesk متاح ضمن خطتي Pro وTeam.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Powered by NivaDesk पंक्ति को छिपाना Pro और Team प्लान का हिस्सा है।"],
    "The accent colour must be a hex value like #2f6f6d.": ["English": "The accent colour must be a hex value like #2f6f6d.", "Türkçe": "Vurgu rengi #2f6f6d gibi bir hex değeri olmalıdır.", "Deutsch": "Die Akzentfarbe muss ein Hex-Wert wie #2f6f6d sein.", "Français": "La couleur d’accent doit être une valeur hexadécimale comme #2f6f6d.", "Italiano": "Il colore in evidenza deve essere un valore esadecimale come #2f6f6d.", "Español (Spanish)": "El color de acento debe ser un valor hexadecimal como #2f6f6d.", "Português": "A cor de destaque deve ser um valor hexadecimal como #2f6f6d.", "Русский (Russian)": "Акцентный цвет должен быть HEX-значением, например #2f6f6d.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "アクセントカラーは #2f6f6d のような16進数カラーコードで指定してください。", "中文 (Chinese)": "主题色必须是十六进制值，例如 #2f6f6d。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يجب أن يكون لون التمييز قيمة سداسية عشرية مثل #2f6f6d.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "एक्सेंट रंग #2f6f6d जैसा हेक्स मान होना चाहिए।"],
    "The branding could not be saved.": ["English": "The branding could not be saved.", "Türkçe": "Markalama kaydedilemedi.", "Deutsch": "Das Branding konnte nicht gespeichert werden.", "Français": "La personnalisation n’a pas pu être enregistrée.", "Italiano": "Impossibile salvare la personalizzazione.", "Español (Spanish)": "No se pudo guardar la marca.", "Português": "Não foi possível salvar a identidade visual.", "Русский (Russian)": "Не удалось сохранить оформление.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ブランディングを保存できませんでした。", "中文 (Chinese)": "品牌设置保存失败。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تعذّر حفظ التخصيص.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "ब्रांडिंग सहेजी नहीं जा सकी।"],
