    "Cancelled and refunded orders are not counted.": ["English": "Cancelled and refunded orders are not counted.", "Türkçe": "İptal edilen ve iade edilen siparişler sayılmaz.", "Deutsch": "Stornierte und erstattete Bestellungen werden nicht mitgezählt.", "Français": "Les commandes annulées et remboursées ne sont pas comptabilisées.", "Italiano": "Gli ordini annullati e rimborsati non vengono conteggiati.", "Español (Spanish)": "Los pedidos cancelados y reembolsados no se contabilizan.", "Português": "Encomendas canceladas e reembolsadas não são contabilizadas.", "Русский (Russian)": "Отменённые и возвращённые заказы не учитываются.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "キャンセルおよび返金済みの注文は集計に含まれません。", "中文 (Chinese)": "已取消和已退款的订单不计入统计。", "العربية (Arabic)": "الطلبات الملغاة والمستردة لا تُحتسب.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "रद्द किए गए और रिफ़ंड किए गए ऑर्डर गिने नहीं जाते।"],
    "Cancelled or refunded": ["English": "Cancelled or refunded", "Türkçe": "İptal veya iade edilen", "Deutsch": "Storniert oder erstattet", "Français": "Annulées ou remboursées", "Italiano": "Annullati o rimborsati", "Español (Spanish)": "Cancelado o reembolsado", "Português": "Cancelada ou reembolsada", "Русский (Russian)": "Отменён или возвращён", "日本語 (Japanese)": "キャンセルまたは返金済み", "中文 (Chinese)": "已取消或已退款", "العربية (Arabic)": "ملغى أو مسترد", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "रद्द या रिफ़ंड किए गए"],
