    "Merge": ["English": "Merge", "Türkçe": "Birleştir", "Deutsch": "Zusammenführen", "Français": "Fusionner", "Italiano": "Unisci", "Español (Spanish)": "Combinar", "Português": "Fundir", "Русский (Russian)": "Объединить", "日本語 (Japanese)": "統合", "中文 (Chinese)": "合并", "العربية (Arabic)": "دمج", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "मर्ज करें"],
